le":"striker","gender":"M","weight":86,"height":180,"base":"UK","birthplace":"England","dateOfBirth":"1981-12-31T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2003-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"From smashmouth strikes to classically applied wrestling holds, Danny Burch embodies many of British wrestling’s most enduring traits. The East Ender’s ring generalship comes from more than 14 years of transatlantic competition, starting with his schooling under English masters Tony & Dino Scarlo. Burch has been knocking out teeth in NXT dating back to 2012, and in January 2017, he notched a new milestone as a competitor in the WWE U.K. Championship Tournament. However, it was The Guv’nor’s sensational series of matches against likeminded toughie Oney Lorcan that summer that opened new doors for the rugged Londoner.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[432,459,1685,2812],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":64,"storytelling":70,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":21,"matchLayout":72,"psychology":64,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":75,"technicalCoaching":62,"characterCoaching":49,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":79,"mediaHandling":49,"brandBuilding":40,"socialMediaSavvy":44,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":75,"consistency":68,"awareness":64,"judgement":78}},{"id":205,"name":"Matt Rehwoldt","realName":"Matt Rehwoldt","picture":"Aiden English.jpg","ability":49,"currentAbility":54,"potentialAbility":54,"charisma":47,"micSkills":57,"popularity":14,"condition":92,"hardcoreAbility":35,"injuryProne":100,"type":"commentator","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":98,"height":187,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1987-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2011-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Matt Rehwoldt is a retired American wrestler who works primarily as a colour commentator. He is best known for his work with WWE, IMPACT, NXT and NJoA. He is married to Shaul Guerrero.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":28,"teams":[1522,1554,2676,3791],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":58,"storytelling":61,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":22,"matchLayout":62,"psychology":58,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":69,"technicalCoaching":44,"characterCoaching":74,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":78,"mediaHandling":74,"brandBuilding":51,"socialMediaSavvy":78,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":69,"consistency":62,"awareness":58,"judgement":75},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-205","wrestlerId":205,"promotionId":28,"startDate":"2021-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":206,"name":"Breeze","realName":"Breeze","picture":"Tyler Breeze.jpg","ability":81,"currentAbility":83,"potentialAbility":83,"charisma":91,"micSkills":88,"popularity":23,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":90,"injuryProne":100,"type":"writer","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":93,"height":180,"base":"Canada","birthplace":"Canada","dateOfBirth":"1988-01-19T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2007-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"poor","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"A deadly fighter in the vein of similarly stunning greats like “Ravishing” Rick Rude, Breeze never misses an opportunity to apply his pristine craft and leave his opponents black and blue in the process. He was an institution during the formative years of WWE NXT, orbiting but never landing the NXT Championship as he took on the likes of Sami Zayn, Finn Bálor, and even international legend Jushin “Thunder” Liger.\r\n\r\nNot that he let any of his losses get him down. Like any social climber looking for the next big thing, Breeze is constantly focused on tackling new challenges, such as teaming with fellow sartorial slueth Fandango as The Fashion Police on SmackDown and issuing citations to anyone who committed a fashion faux pas. That duo stole the hearts of the WWE Universe with their weekly \"Fashion Files\" show, and they achieved their greatest victory by defeating Imperium to become NXT Tag Team Champions.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":65,"teams":[960,2548,3784],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":65,"storytelling":69,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":25,"matchLayout":71,"psychology":65,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":73,"technicalCoaching":58,"characterCoaching":58,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":75,"mediaHandling":58,"brandBuilding":61,"socialMediaSavvy":60,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":73,"consistency":70,"awareness":65,"judgement":79},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-206","wrestlerId":206,"promotionId":65,"startDate":"2022-10-05T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"inDevelopment":true},{"id":208,"name":"Mercedes Moné","realName":"Mercedes Moné","picture":"Sasha Banks.jpg","ability":63,"currentAbility":68,"potentialAbility":68,"charisma":55,"micSkills":66,"popularity":64,"condition":82,"hardcoreAbility":71,"injuryProne":93,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"F","weight":52,"height":162,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirt