true,"dead":false,"story":"Rachel Donaldson is an American professional wrestler who is better known by her ring name MsChif. She has been wrestling since 2001 and in that time has worked for several independent promotions across the United States, with guest matches in England and Japan. Among the various championships she has held during her career, she currently holds two with the National Wrestling Alliance (NWA Midwest Women's Championship and NWA World Women's Championship) alongside the Shimmer Championship and has won the ChickFight tournament once. She is known for her banshee gimmick, howling at her opponents and referees who stand in her way, as well as her unusually flexible body that allows her to perform, and be subjected to, modified submission holds.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[1240],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":71,"storytelling":72,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":25,"matchLayout":72,"psychology":71,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":82,"technicalCoaching":63,"characterCoaching":71,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":75,"mediaHandling":71,"brandBuilding":56,"socialMediaSavvy":56,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":82,"consistency":77,"awareness":71,"judgement":83}},{"id":638,"name":"Matt Jackson","realName":"Matt Jackson","picture":"Matt Jackson.jpg","ability":56,"currentAbility":66,"potentialAbility":66,"charisma":71,"micSkills":62,"popularity":51,"condition":84,"hardcoreAbility":60,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":78,"height":175,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1985-03-13T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2004-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"good","prestige":"mid","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Whenever Matt Jackson and his brother Nick -- collectively known as The Young Bucks -- are on the card, fans can expect excitement, a packed house and an official Superkick Party. There isn’t a tag team in pro wrestling more innovative, high-flying or successful than The Young Bucks, who are multi-time tag team champions in both Ring of Honor and New Japan Pro-Wrestling. They’re also members of Bullet Club, the hottest faction in the industry.\r\n\r\nTheir thrilling rivalry with the Hardys in 2017 concluded with The Young Bucks winning an unforgettable ladder match at Supercard of Honor XI in a passing-of-the-torch moment. In addition to their accomplishments inside the ring, Matt and Nick Jackson have built a merchandising empire and are two of the stars of the popular “Being The Elite” YouTube series.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":76,"teams":[209,1073,1528,1529,1530,1850,1896],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":75,"storytelling":77,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":21,"matchLayout":78,"psychology":75,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":85,"technicalCoaching":66,"characterCoaching":82,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":79,"mediaHandling":82,"brandBuilding":63,"socialMediaSavvy":72,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":85,"consistency":87,"awareness":75,"judgement":85},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-638","wrestlerId":638,"promotionId":76,"startDate":"2019-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":4333,"type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":4333},{"id":639,"name":"Nick Jackson","realName":"Nick Jackson","picture":"Nick Jackson.jpg","ability":73,"currentAbility":67,"potentialAbility":67,"charisma":72,"micSkills":58,"popularity":51,"condition":86,"hardcoreAbility":87,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":81,"height":175,"base"