Wrestling Academy on 01 June 2007, is an Australian wrestler who works in the USA, Canada, Japan and Oceania. She is a 5'8\", 132lb worker who is classed as using a Entertainer style. She uses the Boyfriend Stealer and the School Girl Crush as her finishers. She is one half of The IInspiration alongside Cassie Lee. She is best known for her work with WWE, AEW, TNA, NXT, ROH, PWA, SHIMMER, AAW, WR, CHIKARA and CZW. She is married to someone outside the wrestling business. She is the protege of Madison Eagles.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":49,"teams":[1276,1742,2435,2436,3069,4140,4347],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":44,"storytelling":45,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":34,"matchLayout":45,"psychology":44,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":58,"technicalCoaching":33,"characterCoaching":80,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":66,"mediaHandling":80,"brandBuilding":62,"socialMediaSavvy":77,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":58,"consistency":47,"awareness":44,"judgement":66},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-663","wrestlerId":663,"promotionId":49,"startDate":"2026-02-15T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"inDevelopment":true},{"id":666,"name":"Nicole Matthews","realName":"Nicole Matthews","picture":"Nicole Matthews.jpg","ability":65,"currentAbility":66,"potentialAbility":66,"charisma":76,"micSkills":60,"popularity":7,"condition":89,"hardcoreAbility":65,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"F","weight":86,"height":172,"base":"Canada","birthplace":"Canada","dateOfBirth":"1987-01-15T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2006-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Nicole Matthews is a Canadian professional wrestler who regularly wrestles for Shimmer Women Athletes and NWA: Extreme Canadian Championship Wrestling. She currently teams with fellow Canadian wrestler Portia Perez as the Canadian Ninjas. Matthews was originally convinced to try a career in professional wrestling by her friend, male wrestler Sid Sylum. She made her professional wrestling debut in February 2006 alongside fellow trainee Veronika Vice. Matthews sent a demo tape to Shimmer Women Athletes in December 2006, but was not signed to the promotion. In October 2007, however, Matthews was called to join the company when Portia Perez needed a tag team partner.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":95,"teams":[979],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":75,"storytelling":77,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":14,"matchLayout":77,"psychology":75,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":78,"technicalCoaching":65,"characterCoaching":78,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":86,"mediaHandling":78,"brandBuilding":44,"socialMediaSavvy":67,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":78,"consistency":86,"awareness":75,"judgement":85},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-666","wrestlerId":666,"promotionId":95,"startDate":"2023-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":667,"name":"Portia Perez","realName":"Portia Perez","picture":"Portia Perez.jpg","ability":66,"currentAbility":59,"potentialAbility":59,"charisma":67,"micSkills":47,"popularity":6,"condition":79,"hardcoreAbility":56,"injuryProne":100,"type":"commentator","style":"technical","gender":"F","weight":55,"height":154,"base":"Canada","birthplace":"Canada","dateOfBirth":"1987-10-26T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2004-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"Jenna Grattan is a Canadian professional wrestler best known under the stage name Portia Perez. Perez made her professional debut in summer 2004 for Professional Wrestling Entertainment. While still in high school, Portia took bookings with many companies in Quebec and Ontario, including the promotion she trained with: Universal Wrestling Alliance. In January 2006, Portia took part in her first international tour, spending four weeks in Ireland's Irish Whip Wrestling and England's All Star Wrestling. After returning to Canada, she continued to perform in many Canadian and American companies, including debuting for Shimmer Women Athletes in May 2006. Perez made her Mexican wrestling debut in June 2006 as a masked competitor named Xtasis. She spent three weeks competing for Lucha Libre Feminil as well as appearing for Asistencia Asesoría y Administración (AAA).","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[979],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":69,"storytelling":74,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":21,"matchLayout":76,"psychology":69,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":85,"technicalCoaching":61,"characterCoaching":74,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":79,"mediaHandling":74,"brandBuilding":25,"socialMediaSavvy":67,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":85,"consistency":84,"awareness":69,"judgement":81}},{"id":668,"name":"Christina Von Eerie","realName":"Christina Von Eerie","picture":"Christina Von Eerie.jpg","ability":59,"currentAbility":52,"potentialAbility":52,"charisma":46,"micSkills":46,"popularity":5,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":41,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"F","weight":56,"height":160,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1989-08-28T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Christina Maria Kardooni is an American professional wrestler, better known by her ring name Christina Von Eerie. She is known for working for Asistencia Asesoría y Administración (AAA), Pro Wrestling Guerrilla (PWG) and Total Nonstop Action Wrestling (TNA), where she performed under the ring name Toxxin. In AAA, she held the AAA World Mixed Tag Team Championship with Alex Koslov. After receiving her training at the Supreme Pro Wrestling Training Academy in her hometown of Sacramento, Von Eerie made her professional wrestling debut in 2006 and started working for various professional wrestling promotions on the West Coast. On March 27, 2010, Von Eerie made a one–time appearance for Dragon Gate USA, accompanying Jon Moxley to the ring. On March 2, 2011, Chicago, Illinois–based all–female promotion Shimmer Women Athletes announced that Von Eerie would make her debut for the promotion at the March 26 and 27 tapings.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[1240],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":52,"storytelling":55,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":37,"matchLayout":56,"psychology":52,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":76,"technicalCoaching":51,"characterCoaching":65,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":63,"mediaHandling":65,"brandBuilding":48,"socialMediaSavvy":56,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":76,"consistency":63,"awareness":52,"judgement":71}},{"id":669,"name":"Leva Bates","realName":"Leva Bates","picture":"Leva Bates.jpg","ability":59,"currentAbility":53,"potentialAbility":53,"charisma":64,"micSkills":42,"popularity":9,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility