nard-d'Aston, Quebec, under the ring name Lucifer. In late 1998, she joined the Eastern Wrestling Alliance under the name \"Luscious Lucy\" as \"Centerfold\" Steve Ramsey's valet. She also began appearing at Green Mountain Wrestling shows in Vermont at this point.  She debuted in Shimmer Women Athletes on October 24, 2006 in Berwyn, Illinois. In early June 2009 the birth of a new all Female Canadian promotion, nCw Femmes Fatales, administered by LuFisto and Stephane Bruyere, the former booker of ALF, was announced. On February 21, 2013, Asistencia Asesoría y Administración (AAA) announced that LuFisto had signed with the promotion.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[1128,2670,2915],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":75,"storytelling":77,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":35,"matchLayout":78,"psychology":75,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":74,"technicalCoaching":56,"characterCoaching":73,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":65,"mediaHandling":73,"brandBuilding":61,"socialMediaSavvy":56,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":74,"consistency":75,"awareness":75,"judgement":85}},{"id":671,"name":"Melanie Cruise","realName":"Melanie Cruise","picture":"Melanie Cruise.jpg","ability":42,"currentAbility":49,"potentialAbility":49,"charisma":40,"micSkills":38,"popularity":7,"condition":76,"hardcoreAbility":35,"injuryProne":81,"type":"wrestler","style":"powerhouse","gender":"F","weight":73,"height":180,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1987-01-07T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"Melanie Cruise is an American wrestler who works in America and Canada. She is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Powerhouse style. She is best known for her work with AEW, SHIMMER and AIW.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":52,"storytelling":55,"productFit":58,"riskTaking":27,"matchLayout":56,"psychology":52,"workerManagement":58,"trainingIntensity":52,"technicalCoaching":40,"characterCoaching":48,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":73,"mediaHandling":48,"brandBuilding":40,"socialMediaSavvy":45,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":12,"reactionSpeed":52,"consistency":70,"awareness":52,"judgement":54}},{"id":672,"name":"Rhia O'Reilly","realName":"Rhia O'Reilly","picture":"Rhia Oreilly.jpg","ability":53,"currentAbility":61,"potentialAbility":61,"charisma":72,"micSkills":46,"popularity":4,"condition":72,"hardcoreAbility":68,"injuryProne":100,"type":"writer","style":"technical","gender":"F","weight":65,"height":165,"base":"Other","birthplace":"Unknown","dateOfBirth":"1985-05-13T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2009-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"Rhia O'Reilly is an Irish female wrestler currently working for various indy promotions, including SHIMMER in the United States. Rhia is a feisty and intense young athlete who isn’t afraid to fight dirty to get to the top. Having trained with Jimmy Havoc, Justin Richards as well as with Lance Storm at his world-famous wrestling school, it’s no surprise that Rhia has become a big success story in the UK and continues to impress here in SWA! Having made her debut on the first Pro Wrestling Eve event, O’Reilly has since exploded across the UK wrestling the likes of Sarayah Night, Cheerleader Melissa, MsChief and many more. Her impressive talents have led to Rhia becoming a welcomed regular feature in SWA, battling the best Scotland has to offer and joining the invite-only showcase events at the Source Wrestling School. She has held the WAR Women's Championship in Switzerland.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[1294,2579,2586],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":44,"storytelling":50,"productFit":78,"riskTaking":25,"matchLayout":52,"psychology":44,"workerManagement":78,"trainingIntensity":69,"technicalCoaching":52,"characterCoaching":59,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":75,"mediaHandling":59,"brandBuilding":38,"socialMediaSavvy":47,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":16,"reactionSpeed":69,"consistency":65,"awareness":44,"judgement":58}},{"id":673,"name":"Allysin Kay","realName":"Allysin Kay","picture":"Allysin Kay.jpg","ability":57,"currentAbility":60,"potentialAbility":60,"charisma":74,"micSkills":69,"popularity":18,"condition":86,"hardcoreAbility":54,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"F","weight":68,"height":175,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1987-11-05T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Allysin Kay is an American wrestler who works in America, Canada, the British Isles and Japan. She is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Technician style. She is best known for her work with WWE, AAA, IMPACT, TJPW, ROH, NWA, RevPro, Sendai Girls, SHIMMER, Beyond, EVOLVE, AAW, AIW, Smash, EVE and SWE.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":79,"teams":[2612,2643,3333,3476,3477,3478,3479,4006],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":57,"storytelling":62,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":17,"matchLayout":63,"psychology":57,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":76,"technicalCoaching":56,"characterCoaching":67,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":83,"mediaHandling":67,"brandBuilding":68,"socialMediaSavvy":62,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":76,"consistency":85,"awareness":57,"judgement":74},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-673","wrestlerId":673,"promotionId":79,"startDate":"2025-10-17T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2027-10-17T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2027-10-17T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":675,"name":"Dakota Kai","realName":"Dakota Kai","picture":"Evie.jpg","ability":65,"currentAbility":63,"potentialAbility":63,"charisma":58,"micSkills":74,"popularity":41,"condition":75,"hardcoreAbility":82,"injuryProne":72,"type":"wrestler","style":"all rounder","gender":"F","weight":58,"height":162,"base":"Australia","birthplace":"New Zealand","dateOfBirth":"1988-05-06T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2007-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"fair","prestige":"mid","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"If you’ve seen a woman kick her opponent so hard that chirping cartoon birds pop out at any point over the last 10 years, there’s a good chance it was New Zealand’s Dakota Kai doing the kicking. A former high school track-and-field standout, Kai claims to be your ordinary girl next door, but we’ve yet to live next to someone who can jack jaws the way Kai does. The kick-happy Kiwi perfected her striking ability on the international independent scene for years, competing from Australasia to Japan, before joining the WWE Performance Center in 2017. Kai’s introduction to the WWE Universe came months later, during the inaugural Mae Young Classic, where The Captain of Team Kick stomped her way to the Quarterfinals before being ousted by eventual tournament winner Kairi Sane.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":102,"teams":[568,1363,1942,2806],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{