n":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"An agile acrobat with a fondness for showboating, Rich Swann an exciting part of the Cruiserweight Division.\r\n\r\nThe squared circle became an outlet for Swann to show his passion after a rough upbringing. He immediately took to the mat game and found inspiration in a generation of cruiserweight wrestlers like Eddie Guerrero, Rey Mysterio and Psicosis. Swann made a name for himself on the independent scene by adapting that high-flying style, dazzling audiences around the world with moves like his trademark standing 450 Splash. He also hooked crowds with his infectious charisma, often turning his entrances into karaoke parties, asking his rivals one question: Can you handle this?","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":118,"teams":[1106,1797,1958,3938],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":55,"storytelling":61,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":42,"matchLayout":63,"psychology":55,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":79,"technicalCoaching":56,"characterCoaching":72,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":58,"mediaHandling":72,"brandBuilding":45,"socialMediaSavvy":48,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":79,"consistency":72,"awareness":55,"judgement":73},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-770","wrestlerId":770,"promotionId":118,"startDate":"2025-03-14T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2027-03-14T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2027-03-14T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":772,"name":"Ruckus","realName":"Ruckus","picture":"Ruckus.jpg","ability":55,"currentAbility":51,"potentialAbility":51,"charisma":55,"micSkills":46,"popularity":1,"condition":96,"hardcoreAbility":65,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":107,"height":170,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1978-08-15T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1999-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Claude Marrow is an American independent professional wrestler better known by his ring name Ruckus. Marrow current performs in Combat Zone Wrestling, Ring of Honor, Maryland Championship Wrestling, Chikara and Jersey All Pro Wrestling. While often appearing at a number of other independent promotions, Ruckus is a member of the Blackout/BLKOUT stable with Eddie Kingston, Sabian, Joker, and Robbie Mireno. Ruckus began training in September 1998 at Brainbusters. A former backyard wrestler with HCW (Hardcore Championship Wrestling), Ruckus made his official professional wrestling debut against Chad Olsen on April 18, 1999 for the Mid-Eastern Wrestling Federation (MEWF).","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[951,3201,3202],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":36,"storytelling":44,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":37,"matchLayout":47,"psychology":36,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":75,"technicalCoaching":55,"characterCoaching":67,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":63,"mediaHandling":67,"brandBuilding":46,"socialMediaSavvy":59,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":75,"consistency":70,"awareness":36,"judgement":62}},{"id":774,"name":"BLK Jeez","realName":"BLK Jeez","picture":"BLK Jeez.jpg","ability":60,"currentAbility":57,"potentialAbility":57,"charisma":72,"micSkills":43,"popularity":4,"condition":73,"hardcoreAbility":54,"injuryProne":100,"type":"manager","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":73,"height":165,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1975-04-25T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2000-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"BLK Jeez is an American wrestler who works in America and Canada. He is a Small worker who is classed as using a Daredevil style. He is one half of BLKOUT alongside Ruckus. He is best known for his work with NWA, BJW, ICW NHB, IWA-MS, C4, CHIKARA and CZW.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":79,"teams":[907,951,3199,3200,3201,3202,3205],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":54,"storytelling":59,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":40,"matchLayout":61,"psychology":54,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":62,"technicalCoaching":44,"characterCoaching":68,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":60,"mediaHandling":68,"brandBuilding":35,"socialMediaSavvy":66,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":62,"consistency":68,"awareness":54,"judgement":72},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-774","wrestlerId":774,"promotionId":79,"startDate":"2021-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":775,"name":"Matt Tremont","realName":"Matt Tremont","picture":"Matt Tremont.jpg","ability":39,"currentAbility":48,"potentialAbility":48,"charisma":37,"micSkills":49,"popularity":4,"condition":69,"hardcoreAbility":45,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"hardcore","gender":"M","weight":113,"height":172,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1989-03-09T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2010-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"\"Bulldozer\" Matt Tremont is an American professional wrestler who currently works for Combat Zone Wrestling (CZW) and westside Xtreme wrestling (wXw). In addition he has appeared in IWA Mid-South, IWA Deep-South and IWA East Coast where he is the winner of Masters of Pain in 2012. Tremont made his Combat Zone Wrestling debut at Prelude to Violence defeating Pinkie Sanchez in a Tournament of Death X Qualifying Ultraviolent Rules on June 11, 2012. Tremont began to feud with CZW Owner DJ Hyde throughout 2012 beginning at A Tangled Web between the two as Hyde was the victor. Tremont was subsequently fired.  DJ Hyde cut a promo on not reinstating Tremont. Prompting the locker room to walk out and quit if Tremont is not reinstated, but Hyde insisted if Tremont wins a match he could be reinstated.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[2969,3399,3400,3401,4299,4337],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":45,"storytelling":48,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":37,"matchLayout":49,"psychology":45,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":53,"technicalCoaching":22,"characterCoaching":63,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":63,"mediaHandling":63,"brandBuilding":15,"socialMediaSavvy":51,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":53,"consistency":68,"awareness":45,"judgement":67}},{"id":777,"name":"Eric Corvis","realName":"Eric Corvis","picture":"Eric Corvis.jpg","ability":38,"currentAbility":43,"potentialAbility":43,"charisma":58,"micSkills":55,"popularity":2,"condition":79,"hardcoreAbility":34,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":91,"height":180,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1984-07-03T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2001-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Eric Haraskin is an American professional wrestler better known by his ring names, Corvis Fear and Eric Corvis. Corvis made his in ring debut in October 2001 after training from Mafia, MAGIC, Skinhead Ivan. He is most notable for the time he spent with the CZW promotion.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":44,"storytelling":49,"productFit":90,"riskTaking":53,"matchLayout":50,"psychology":44,"workerManagement":90,"trainingIntensity":69,"technicalCoaching":38,"characterCoaching":62,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":47,"mediaHandling":62,"brandBuilding":49,"socialMediaSavvy":51,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":18,"reactionSpeed":69,"consistency":75,"awareness":44,"judgement":62}},{"id":780,"name":"Lucky 13","realName":"Lucky 13","picture":"Lucky 13.jpg","ability":39,"currentAbility":37,"potentialAbility":37,"charisma":52,"micSkills":49,"popularity":1,"condition":90,"hardcoreAbility":30,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"hardcore","gender":"M","weight":84,"height":165,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1984-09-19T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Kevin Papics better known by his ring names Retail Dragon in Chikara and Lucky, tHURTeen or Lucky 13 in Combat Zone Wrestling (CZW) is an American professional wrestler. Papics was trained at the Chikara Wrestle Factory by Mike Quackenbush and Chris Hero and debuted for Chikara in 2005. While in Chikara he wrestled as the Retail Dragon; nicknamed the \"Xtreme Customer Service Specialist\" and whilst there he formed a tag team with Dragon Dragon, known as Triple Dragon. In conjunction with apprearing in Chikara, Papics wrestled as \"Lucky\" in Pro Wrestling Unplugged and several other independent promotions, including CZW, where he tagged with JC Ryder as \"the New Jersey All Stars.\" In 2010 Papics made his return to Combat Zone Wr