"Jon Davis is an American professional wrestler, working for independent promotions including Dragon Gate USA, Full Impact Pro, and Evolve. Davis is a two-time former NWA World Tag Team Champion and a former NWA Florida Tag Team Champion as part of the Dark City Fight Club with Kory Chavis. Davis was trained by Chris Turner and Dory Funk, Jr., and made his professional wrestling debut on June 23, 2003. In late 2005, Davis began wrestling for Funk's !Bang! promotion. In March 2008, Davis teamed with up Kory Chavis as the Dark City Fight Club (DCFC) in Full Impact Pro (FIP).","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[2996,3408],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":56,"storytelling":60,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":26,"matchLayout":62,"psychology":56,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":68,"technicalCoaching":64,"characterCoaching":61,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":74,"mediaHandling":61,"brandBuilding":38,"socialMediaSavvy":53,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":68,"consistency":76,"awareness":56,"judgement":74}},{"id":1058,"name":"Corey Hollis","realName":"Corey Hollis","picture":"Corey Hollis.jpg","ability":57,"currentAbility":60,"potentialAbility":60,"charisma":59,"micSkills":51,"popularity":1,"condition":90,"hardcoreAbility":71,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":86,"height":167,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1989-01-10T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2009-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"Corey Hollis was an American wrestler who has since left the business. He had regular tag teams with Mike Posey (Alabama Attitude), Adam Page (Country Jacked) and John Skyler (Bruiserweights). He is best known for his work with AEW, NXT and ROH. He is married to someone outside the wrestling business.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[327,652,1591],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":66,"storytelling":68,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":20,"matchLayout":69,"psychology":66,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":77,"technicalCoaching":61,"characterCoaching":48,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":80,"mediaHandling":48,"brandBuilding":38,"socialMediaSavvy":42,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":77,"consistency":73,"awareness":66,"judgement":80}},{"id":1060,"name":"Sugar Dunkerton","realName":"Sugar Dunkerton","picture":"Sugar Dunkerton.jpg","ability":56,"currentAbility":59,"potentialAbility":59,"charisma":59,"micSkills":67,"popularity":5,"condition":86,"hardcoreAbility":44,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"powerhouse","gender":"M","weight":79,"height":180,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1984-02-21T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2002-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Sugar Dunkerton, also known as \"Slam McNasty\" (among other nicknames), is a boisterous ballhog who not only brings the pain on the court, but in the professional wrestling ring as well. He calls CHIKARA Pro home, but has found his charismatic stylings used in Resistance Pro, Beyond Wrestling, Dragon Gate USA, CZW, Force-1, and others while also finding time to tour Japan, Ireland, and Puerto Rico. Outspoken. Outlandish. Out of this world. Who knows what's next for the Chocolate Ice Cream Dream? With goals as big as his hair; the sky is the limit!","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[540,1763,2634],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":56,"storytelling":61,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":21,"matchLayout":62,"psychology":56,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":79,"technicalCoaching":57,"characterCoaching":78,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":79,"mediaHandling":78,"brandBuilding":43,"socialMediaSavvy":70,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":79,"consistency":78,"awareness":56,"judgement":74}},{"id":1061,"name":"Gabe Sapolsky","realName":"Gabe Sapolsky","picture":"Gabe Sapolsky.jpg","ability":92,"currentAbility":85,"potentialAbility":85,"charisma":92,"micSkills":85,"popularity":6,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":70,"injuryProne":21,"type":"writer","style":"all rounder","gender":"M","weight":89,"height":170,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1972-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1993-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Gabe Sapolsky is a creative and marketing expert in the professional wrestling world. He is the current vice president of Dragon Gate USA and co-owner of Evolve, and the creator of Ring of Honor and booker of Full Impact Pro. Sapolsky also worked for Extreme Championship Wrestling in numerous capacities including marketing, promoting, public relations and administrative assistant to Paul Heyman.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":65,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":70,"storytelling":69,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":100,"matchLayout":69,"psychology":70,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":0,"technicalCoaching":0,"characterCoaching":56,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":0,"mediaHandling":56,"brandBuilding":15,"socialMediaSavvy":51,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":0,"consistency":0,"awareness":70,"judgement":82},"co