 viewers a unique level of insight as the VP of the office of Wrestling Operations, no other fight analyst can give you the depth of knowledge on the fighters and their backgrounds as well as the rivalries.\r\n\r\nAs a fight analysis, Saint Laurent brings his 23 years of knowledge, experience and analysis across all MLW platforms.\r\n\r\nStarting with MLW in December 2002, Saint Laurent began his journey to ultimately becoming senior management as a member of the ring crew. The Florida native would along the way wear many hats, including podcaster on the MLW Radio Network, COO and now fight analyst.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":68,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":57,"storytelling":59,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":28,"matchLayout":60,"psychology":57,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":62,"technicalCoaching":37,"characterCoaching":55,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":72,"mediaHandling":55,"brandBuilding":23,"socialMediaSavvy":53,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":62,"consistency":63,"awareness":57,"judgement":74},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1065","wrestlerId":1065,"promotionId":68,"startDate":"2017-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":1066,"name":"Uhaa Nation","realName":"Uhaa Nation","picture":"Uhaa Nation.jpg","ability":58,"currentAbility":62,"potentialAbility":62,"charisma":67,"micSkills":67,"popularity":26,"condition":89,"hardcoreAbility":77,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":110,"height":182,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1987-08-22T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2009-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"poor","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Naming yourself after a Greek god sets one hell of a bar, but it’s fair to say Apollo Crews may well clear it when all is said and done.\r\n\r\nWith an Olympian's physique and agility, the hulking Crews combines the raw power of The Ultimate Warrior with the agility of a top cruiserweight, confounding opponents with a ground-and-pound game and a dizzying aerial attack. He was already the proverbial five-tool player when he went from the independent scene to WWE NXT, and his astounding record at Full Sail sent the Georgia native to the main WWE roster within a year of his debut.\r\n\r\nAlmost immediately after his move to Monday Night Raw in the 2017 Superstar Shake-up, Crews was courted by Titus O'Neil, who wanted to sign the budding young prodigy to Titus Worldwide.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":28,"teams":[1719],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":58,"storytelling":64,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":22,"matchLayout":66,"psychology":58,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":80,"technicalCoaching":45,"characterCoaching":50,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":78,"mediaHandling":50,"brandBuilding":70,"socialMediaSavvy":48,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":80,"consistency":73,"awareness":58,"judgement":75},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1066","wrestlerId":1066,"promotionId":28,"startDate":"2026-06-28T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-07-10T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-07-10T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":1069,"name":"Jay Rios","realName":"Jay Rios","picture":"Jay Rios.jpg","ability":57,"currentAbility":55,"potentialAbility":55,"charisma":68,"micSkills":46,"popularity":5,"condition":90,"hardcoreAbility":40,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wr