ht with Nigerian K-1 kickboxer, Film actor and male model Andy Ologun. Yukio is the son of former judoka and professional wrestling legend Seiji Sakaguchi and the older brother of former Urawa Red Diamonds player turned actor Kenji Sakaguchi. In 2009 Yukio was featured in Kamui Gaiden; the film was a box office hit in Japan and the Netherlands.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[2379],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":63,"storytelling":68,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":27,"matchLayout":69,"psychology":63,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":83,"technicalCoaching":69,"characterCoaching":68,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":73,"mediaHandling":68,"brandBuilding":72,"socialMediaSavvy":62,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":83,"consistency":77,"awareness":63,"judgement":78}},{"id":1479,"name":"Aja Kong","realName":"Aja Kong","picture":"Aja Kong.jpg","ability":74,"currentAbility":69,"potentialAbility":69,"charisma":60,"micSkills":54,"popularity":19,"condition":55,"hardcoreAbility":82,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"submission","gender":"F","weight":103,"height":162,"base":"Japan","birthplace":"Japan","dateOfBirth":"1970-09-25T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1986-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Erika Shishido  is a professional wrestler, better known by the stage name Aja Kong, and the founder of the ARSION all-women professional wrestling promotion. Shishido has won several championships in both singles and tag team divisions throughout her career, primarily while with All Japan Women's Pro-Wrestling. Shishido was trained by AJW, and graduated as part of their class of 1986. She made her debut that summer, and immediately joined Dump Matsumoto's heel stable Gokuaku Domei. Aja 