ico and Japan. She is a Small worker who is classed as using a Technician Flyer style. She is best known for her work with NWA.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":61,"storytelling":66,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":22,"matchLayout":67,"psychology":61,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":72,"technicalCoaching":52,"characterCoaching":62,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":78,"mediaHandling":62,"brandBuilding":54,"socialMediaSavvy":47,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":72,"consistency":67,"awareness":61,"judgement":77}},{"id":1688,"name":"Shark Boy","realName":"Shark Boy","picture":"Shark Boy.jpg","ability":51,"currentAbility":48,"potentialAbility":48,"charisma":52,"micSkills":41,"popularity":4,"condition":83,"hardcoreAbility":34,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":92,"height":175,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1975-01-28T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1997-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Dean Matthew Roll is an American professional wrestler, better known by his ring name Shark Boy. Roll began training under Les Thatcher in October 1995 at the age of twenty. He debuted on May 3, 1997 in Thatcher's Heartland Wrestling Association, wrestling as the masked El Piranha. An HWA mainstay, Roll also occasionally portrayed the character of Dean Baldwin, the purported fifth, lesser known Baldwin brother. Later that year, debuted in the Independent Wrestling Association, where he developed the cartoonish character Shark Boy, partly inspired by the 1995 song \"I Come From the Water\" by the Toadies.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":26,"storytelling":41,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":34,"matchLayout":46,"psychology":26,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":69,"technicalCoaching":44,"characterCoaching":77,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":66,"mediaHandling":77,"brandBuilding":50,"socialMediaSavvy":67,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":69,"consistency":68,"awareness":26,"judgement":56}},{"id":1689,"name":"Mandy Leon","realName":"Mandy Leon","picture":"Mandy Leon.jpg","ability":44,"currentAbility":37,"potentialAbility":37,"charisma":38,"micSkills":51,"popularity":4,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":19,"injuryProne":99,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"F","weight":54,"height":165,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1992-03-03T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2014-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"Mandy Leon is a professional wrestler trained by Ring Of Honor Wrestling and ROH DOJO's Head trainer Delirious. Mandy Leon often works for independent promotions including Ring Of Honor. Mandy also has worked as a model, actress, and dancer. Mandy's devoted, committed, and in love with Professional Wrestling. Mandy is an ROH Dojo Graduate and still continues to train at the ROH Dojo to be the best athlete possible. When Leon is not training at ROH Dojo, she is in her local gym full force doing Sports Performance and Physical training to be in the best shape possible.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[2521],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":38,"storytelling":41,"productFit":29,"riskTaking":37,"matchLayout":42,"psychology":38,"workerManagement":29,"trainingIntensity":61,"technicalCo