tates","dateOfBirth":"1987-09-04T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2013-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"When you combine amped-up enthusiasm with a side of Southern style, you have Wesley Blake. A proud resident cowboy of NXT, one might have to surgically remove the smile off Blake’s face on a daily basis. Inspired by his “Cowboy Up” motto, Blake anticipates the peaks and valleys ahead and the celebration of victory at the finish line. Trained by Dory Funk Jr.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":65,"teams":[950,1809,2064,3488],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":63,"storytelling":65,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":21,"matchLayout":66,"psychology":63,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":75,"technicalCoaching":56,"characterCoaching":53,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":79,"mediaHandling":53,"brandBuilding":53,"socialMediaSavvy":47,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":75,"consistency":74,"awareness":63,"judgement":78},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1691","wrestlerId":1691,"promotionId":65,"startDate":"2024-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":4333,"type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":4333,"inDevelopment":true},{"id":1692,"name":"Donovan Dijak","realName":"Donovan Dijak","picture":"Donovan Dijak.jpg","ability":66,"currentAbility":64,"potentialAbility":64,"charisma":55,"micSkills":79,"popularity":32,"condition":93,"hardcoreAbility":50,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"powerhouse","gender":"M","weight":122,"height":198,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1987-04-23T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2012-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"poor","prestige":"low","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Donovan Dijak is an American wrestler who works in the USA, Canada, Mexico, the British Isles, Europe and India. He is a 6'7\", 270lb worker who is classed as using a Powerhouse style. He uses The Dijection, the Overhead Belly to Belly Suplex and the Reverse Death Valley Driver as his finishers. He is best known for his work with WWE, NXT, PWG, ROH, wXw, MLW, RevPro, Beyond, EVOLVE, PROGRESS, OTT, A1 and WXM. He is currently a MLW World Tag Team champion. He is dating someone outside the wrestling business.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":68,"teams":[2460,4221],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":67,"storytelling":69,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":27,"matchLayout":69,"psychology":67,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":75,"technicalCoaching":52,"characterCoaching":64,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":73,"mediaHandling":64,"brandBuilding":71,"socialMediaSavvy":64,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":75,"consistency":80,"awareness":67,"judgement":80},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1692","wrestlerId":1692,"promotionId":68,"startDate":"2024-08-29T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-08-29T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-08-29T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":1693,"name":"Eddie Guerrero","realName":"Eddie Guerrero","picture":"Eddie Guerrero.jpg","ability":65,"currentAbility":63,"potentialAbility":63,"charisma":60,"micSkills":60,"popularity":51,"condition":79,"hardcoreAbility":59,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"all rounder","gender":"M","weight":103,"height":170,"base":"Mexico","birthplace":"Mexico","dateOfBirth":"1967-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1987-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"good","prestige":"mid","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":true,"story":"Eduardo Gory \"Eddie\" Guerrero Llanes was a Mexican-American professional wrestler born into the Guerrero wrestling family. He wrestled in Mexico and Japan for several major professional wrestling promotions. In the United States, Guerrero wrestled in Extreme Championship Wrestling (ECW), World Championship Wrestling (WCW), and in World Wrestling Entertainment (WWE). Guerrero's gimmick was that of \"Latino Heat\", a crafty, resourceful wrestler who would do anything to win a match. Guerrero won 23 titles during his career, which encompassed the WWE Grand Slam Championship. On November 13, 2005, Guerrero was found dead in his motel room at The Marriott City Center in Minneapolis, Minnesota, by his nephew, Chavo. Chavo attempted CPR, but Guerrero was pronounced dead when paramedics arrived at the scene.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[3164,3165],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":63,"storytelling":72,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":30,"matchLayout":75,"psychology":63,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":83,"technicalCoaching":63,"characterCoaching":77,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":70,"mediaHandling":77,"brandBuilding":76,"socialMediaSavvy":72,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":83,"consistency":60,"awareness":63,"judgement":78}},{"id":1694,"name":"Randy Savage","realName":"Randy Savage","picture":"Randy Savage.jpg","ability":52,"currentAbility":49,"potentialAbility":49,"charisma":45,"micSkills":35,"popularity":24,"condition":72,"hardcoreAbility":65,"injuryProne":21,"type":"wrestler","style":"all rounder","gender":"M","weight":108,"height":185,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1952-11-15T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1973-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"poor","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":true,"story":"Randy Mario Poffo, better known by his ring name \"Macho Man\" Randy Savage, was an American professional wrestler and occasional color commentator best known for his time in the World Wrestling Federation (WWF) and World Championship Wrestling (WCW). He is considered to be one of the greatest pro wrestlers in history. Savage won 20 championships during his 32-year career. He held six world championships between the WWF and WCW, having won the WWF Championship twice and the WCW World Heavyweight Championship four times. He also won the ICW World Heavyweight Championship three times and the USWA Unified World Heavyweight Championship once. Savage is a one-time WWF Intercontinental Champion; WWE (formerly WWF) has named him the greatest champion of all time and credited him for bringing \"a higher level of credibility to the title through his amazing in-ring performances. On the morning of May 20, 2011, Savage died after suffering a sudden heart attack.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[1220],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":72,"storytelling":77,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":81,"matchLayout":79,"psychology":72,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":17,"technicalCoaching":15,"characterCoaching":81,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":19,"mediaHandling":81,"brandBuilding":83,"socialMediaSavvy":47,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":17,"consistency":17,"awareness":72,"judgement":83}},{"id":1695,"name":"Dragon Lee","realName":"Dragon Lee","picture":"Dragon Lee II.jpg","ability":59,"currentAbility":62,"potentialAbility":62,"charisma":55,"micSkills":48,"popularity":39,"condition":94,"hardcoreAbility":82,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":75,"height":167,"base":"Mexico","birthplace":"Mexico","dateOfBirth":"1995-05-15T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2014-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"fair","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Dragon Lee is a masked Mexican luchador who works exclusively in North America. He is a 5'7\", 165lb worker who is classed as using a Luchador style. He uses the Desnucadora and the Incineration Knee as his finishers. He is one half of Los Hermanos Lee alongside Dralistico. He is best known for his work with WWE, NJPW, CMLL, AEW, NXT, AAA, PWG, ROH, MLW and The Crash. He is married to someone outside the wrestling business. He was voted Male Young Wrestler Of The Year in 2014.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":64,"teams":[3161,3533],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":64,"storytelling":70,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":25,"matchLayout":72,"psychology":64,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":85,"technicalCoaching":75,"characterCoaching":61,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":75,"mediaHandling":61,"brandBuilding":70,"socialMediaSavvy":42,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":85,"consistency":80,"awareness":64,"judgement":78},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1695","wrestlerId":1695,"promotionId":64,"startDate":"2023-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":4333,"type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":4333},{"id":1696,"name":"Joker","realName":"Joker","picture":"Joker.jpg","ability":51,"currentAbility":55,"potentialAbility":55,"charisma":47,"micSkills":68,"popularity":1,"condition":92,"hardcoreAbility":55,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":86,"height":180,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1983-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2000-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Joker is an American independent professional wrestler who worked for the Combat Zone Wrestling promotion, IWA Mid-South, Chikara and UWA Hardcore Wrestling. It was shortly after CZW Redemption that Joker announced his retirement. Joker returned on May 10th at CZW at Proving Ground 2014, and defeated Azreal via the Shining Wizard","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[2717,3199,3200,3203,3204,3205],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":51,"storytelling":57,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":63,"matchLayout":59,"psychology":51,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":67,"technicalCoaching":53,"characterCoaching":63,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":37,"mediaHandling":63,"brandBuilding":24,"socialMediaSavvy":42,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":67,"consistency":53,"awareness":51,"judgement":71}},{"id":1698,"name":"Fuerza Guerrera","realName":"Fuerza Guerrera","picture":"Fuerza Guerrera.jpg","ability":56,"currentAbility":51,"potentialAbility":51,"charisma":42,"micSkills":39,"popularity":8,"condition":45,"hardcoreAbility":65,"injuryProne":80,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":82,"height":167,"base":"Mexico","birthplace":"Mexico","dateOfBirth":"1953-12-14T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1977-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":true,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"Fuerza Guerrera is a Mexican Luchador enmascarado. who made his debut in 1978. In his career Guerrera has worked for ever major wrestling organization in Mexico including Consejo Mundial de Lucha Libre (CMLL), Asistencia Asesoría y Administración (AAA), Universal Wrestling Association (UWA), World Wrestling Association (WWA) and International Wrestling Revolution Group (IWRG). Throughout his career Fuerza Guerrera has held many titles for CMLL, AAA and IWRG. Fuerza Guerrera's real name is not a matter of public record, as is often the case with masked wrestlers in Mexico where their private lives are kept a secret from the wrestling fans. He has a son who wrestles, better known as luchador Juventud Guerrera. Fuerza Guerrera is Spanish for \"Warrior Strength\", not to be mistaken for the surname Guerrero.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":77,"storytelling":82,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":53,"matchLayout":83,"psychology":77,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":49,"technicalCoaching":45,"characterCoaching":49,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":47,"mediaHandling":49,"brandBuilding":30,"socialMediaSavvy":35,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":49,"consistency":33,"awareness":77,"judgement":86}},{"id":1699,"name":"Shiori Asahi","realName":"Shiori Asahi","picture":"Shiori Asahi.jpg","ability":62,"currentAbility":52,"potentialAbility":52,"charisma":44,"micSkills":40,"popularity":2,"condition":81,"hardcoreAbility":49,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":78,"height":172,"base":"Japan","birthplace":"Japan","dateOfBirth":"1978-02-17T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2002-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Shiori Asahi is a Japanese wrestler who works exclusively in Japan. He is a Small worker who is classed as using a Technician Flyer style. He is best known for his work with NOAH, DDT, BJW, AJPW and GanPro.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[2936],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[]