03-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"Kyoko Kimura  a Japanese professional wrestler and mixed martial artist, currently wrestling for Ice Ribbon, Okinawa Pro Wrestling and World Wonder Ring Stardom. She is an alumnus of Big Japan Pro Wrestling, NEO Japan Ladies Pro Wrestling and Ibuki. Most notably, she is known for her Jamaican flag shirt and puffed afro that at one point stood at roughly one foot tall. Among the notable opponents she has wrestled is Shimmer wrestler, MsChif. She is known for wrestling in barbed wire deathmatches as well as her singles bouts.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[1140,1261,1616],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":73,"storytelling":74,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":39,"matchLayout":75,"psychology":73,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":69,"technicalCoaching":60,"characterCoaching":79,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":61,"mediaHandling":79,"brandBuilding":30,"socialMediaSavvy":62,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":69,"consistency":56,"awareness":73,"judgement":84}},{"id":1794,"name":"Mayu Iwatani","realName":"Mayu Iwatani","picture":"Mayu Iwatani.jpg","ability":70,"currentAbility":75,"potentialAbility":75,"charisma":62,"micSkills":78,"popularity":33,"condition":84,"hardcoreAbility":80,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"F","weight":50,"height":162,"base":"Japan","birthplace":"Japan","dateOfBirth":"1993-02-19T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2011-01-23T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"poor","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Mayu Iwatani, who graduated from Stardom Dojo on 01 January 2010, is a Japanese wrestler who works in the USA, the British Isles, Japan