ills":78,"popularity":6,"condition":62,"hardcoreAbility":90,"injuryProne":87,"type":"writer","style":"high flyer","gender":"F","weight":48,"height":144,"base":"Japan","birthplace":"Japan","dateOfBirth":"1974-11-29T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1991-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":true,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"Command Bolshoi  is a Japanese professional wrestler. She currently works as the president of JWP Joshi Puroresu promotion, where she is a former one-time JWP Openweight Champion, a six-time JWP Tag Team Champion and a three-time Daily Sports Women's Tag Team Champion. Bolshoi has worked under mask for a majority of her career and has managed to keep her real name, birthday and birthplace secret.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":70,"teams":[3347],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":69,"storytelling":75,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":22,"matchLayout":77,"psychology":69,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":51,"technicalCoaching":82,"characterCoaching":69,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":78,"mediaHandling":69,"brandBuilding":56,"socialMediaSavvy":40,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":51,"consistency":58,"awareness":69,"judgement":81},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1808","wrestlerId":1808,"promotionId":70,"startDate":"2019-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":1809,"name":"Ash by Elegance","realName":"Ash by Elegance","picture":"Dana Brooke.jpg","ability":38,"currentAbility":45,"potentialAbility":45,"charisma":49,"micSkills":41,"popularity":28,"condition":86,"hardcoreAbility":61,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"F","weight":57,"height":157,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1988-11-29T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2014-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"poor","prestige":"low","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Ash by Elegance, who graduated from WWE Performance Center on 01 September 2014, is an American wrestler who works in the USA and Canada. She is a 5'3\", 125lb worker who is classed as using a Regular style. She uses the Samoan Driver as her finisher. She is best known for her work with WWE, TNA and NXT.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":28,"teams":[995,2074,2339,3797],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":54,"storytelling":54,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":30,"matchLayout":54,"psychology":54,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":63,"technicalCoaching":27,"characterCoaching":60,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":70,"mediaHandling":60,"brandBuilding":64,"socialMediaSavvy":63,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":63,"consistency":65,"awareness":54,"judgement":72},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1809","wrestlerId":1809,"promotionId":28,"startDate":"2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":1810,"name":"Carmella","realName":"Carmella","picture":"Carmella.jpg","ability":56,"currentAbility":50,"potentialAbility":50,"charisma":51,"micSkills":50,"popularity":42,"condition":89,"hardcoreAbility":54,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"powerhouse","gender":"F","weight":50,"height":162,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1987-10-23T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2013-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"fair","prestige":"mid","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"By reading her background on paper, you’d be forgiven if you assumed that Carmella was never going to make it in WWE. A former Laker girl who found her first success as the third wheel of a boys’ club with two of NXT’s most popular stars, the so-called “Princess of Staten Island” seemed destined for a steady, if unremarkable, career when she was chosen as the very last pick of the 2016 WWE Draft to fill out SmackDown LIVE’s Women’s division.\r\n\r\nHow wrong those assumptions would have been. In just a couple of short years, Carmella’s résumé expanded at lightning speeds. She won the first-ever Women’s Money in the Bank Match (and the second), defeated no less a talent than Charlotte Flair to win the SmackDown Women’s Championship, and won the second-ever WrestleMania Women’s Battle Royal. Her competitiveness is matched only by her creativity, which exploded in the freewheeling sideshow of the Mixed Match Challenge, where she joined forces with R-Truth.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[2074],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":53,"storytelling":56,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":30,"matchLayout":57,"psychology":53,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":64,"technicalCoaching":43,"characterCoaching":70,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":70,"mediaHandling":70,"brandBuilding":78,"socialMediaSavvy":66,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":64,"consistency":70,"awareness":53,"judgement":72}},{"id":1811,"name":"Cash Wheeler","realName":"Cash Wheeler","picture":"Dash Wilder.jpg","ability":67,"currentAbility":74,"potentialAbility":74,"charisma":66,"micSkills":59,"popularity":48,"condition":82,"hardcoreAbility":75,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":94,"height":172,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1987-05-17T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2005-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"fair","prestige":"mid","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Daniel Marshall Wheeler is an American worker from North Carolina best known for his time in WWE under the name Dash Wilder, where he teamed with Scott Dawson as The Revival. Their old school 80s style of tag team wrestling led to them being compared favourably with The Brain Busters (Arn Anderson & Tully Blanchard) and they gained a reputation for having consistently great matches while in NXT. Despite becoming 3-time tag team champions after being called up to the main roster in 2017, they were plagued by poor booking and had multiple requests for their release turned down before finally being let go in April 2020. The former Dash now goes by the name Cash Wheeler and continues to team with Dawson, now named Dax Harwood, under the name \"FTR\" - a reference to their online feud with The Young Bucks through their web series Being The Elite.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":76,"teams":[1494,1495,1592,2048,2077,3502,3590,3641],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":82,"storytelling":83,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":18,"matchLayout":83,"psychology":82,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":86,"technicalCoaching":69,"characterCoaching":57,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":82,"mediaHandling":57,"brandBuilding":58,"socialMediaSavvy":54,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":86,"consistency":88,"awareness":82,"judgement":89},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1811","wrestlerId":1811,"promotionId":76,"startDate":"2020-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":1812,"name":"Rich Bocchini","realName":"Rich Bocchini","picture":"Rich Brennan.jpg","ability":49,"currentAbility":58,"potentialAbility":58,"charisma":59,"micSkills":46,"popularity":1,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":71,"injuryProne":66,"type":"commentator","style":"all rounder","gender":"M","weight":72,"height":170,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1980-03-07T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2014-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Rich Bocchini is a play-by-play commentator for Major League Wrestling, since MLW: One-Shot in 2017.\r\n\r\nHe is a TV and radio play-by-play announcer, known primarily through his work in professional hockey as well as professional wrestling.\r\n\r\nRich appeared on WWE television programming  and his voice was the soundtrack for many of the cornerstone moments of WWE’s NXT brand. He served as the play-by-play voice of SmackDown, Main Event and Superstars and had the honor of calling the action from ringside at Madison Square Garden for the WWE Network’s first live special from the storied arena. In addition to his on-air work, Rich also worked behind the scenes at the WWE Performance Center and in production at NXT live events.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":95,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":0,"storytelling":0,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":100,"matchLayout":0,"psychology":0,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":0,"technicalCoaching":0,"characterCoaching":37,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":0,"mediaHandling":37,"brandBuilding":16,"socialMediaSavvy":37,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":0,"reactionSpeed":0,"consistency":0,"awareness":0,"judgement":0},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1812","wrestlerId":1812,"promotionId":95,"startDate":"2018-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":1817,"name":"Wild Boar","realName":"Wild Boar","picture":"Wild Boar.jpg","ability":49,"currentAbility":51,"potentialAbility":51,"charisma":37,"micSkills":48,"popularity":3,"condition":87,"hardcoreAbility":35,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"striker","gender":"M","weight":93,"height":165,"base":"UK","birthplace":"Wales","dateOfBirth":"1989-10-12T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Wild Boar is an animalistic competitor who has stalked his prey across the United Kingdom, Norway and Spain as both a singles competitor and tag team specialist. With unnerving black eyes, the unhinged self-proclaimed “Welsh Wrestler-Man” is as vicious as they come, with as little restraint inside the squared circle as he has teeth in his head (many of his pearly whites were knocked out in a bar fight against four other men, in which he refused to go down).\r\n\r\nLike the snorting creature he emulates, Wild Boar is not someone to turn your back on, as he possesses the ability to ram through an opponent in the corner, hurl them over his head at high velocity or just ground them into submission.\r\n\r\nNXT UK has been warned. Wild Boar is loose and coming for you.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[1632,1801,1893,3247,3248],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":51,"storytelling":57,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":37,"matchLayout":59,"psychology":51,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":75,"technicalCoaching":38,"characterCoaching":49,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":63,"mediaHandling":