":0,"micSkills":0,"popularity":1,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":0,"injuryProne":0,"type":"writer","style":"all rounder","gender":"M","weight":64,"height":162,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1952-06-28T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2013-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":true,"story":"Joe Koff is an American man who tends to stay behind the scenes in the wrestling world. He is best known for his work with ROH. He is the current owner of ROH.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":0,"storytelling":0,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":100,"matchLayout":0,"psychology":0,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":0,"technicalCoaching":0,"characterCoaching":15,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":0,"mediaHandling":15,"brandBuilding":0,"socialMediaSavvy":8,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":0,"reactionSpeed":0,"consistency":0,"awareness":0,"judgement":0}},{"id":1893,"name":"Sherri Martel","realName":"Sherri Martel","picture":"Sherri Martel.jpg","ability":31,"currentAbility":29,"potentialAbility":29,"charisma":30,"micSkills":41,"popularity":0,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":24,"injuryProne":0,"type":"wrestler","style":"all rounder","gender":"F","weight":63,"height":167,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1958-02-08T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":true,"story":"Sherri Schrull as an American professional wrestler and manager, better known by her ring names, Sherri Martel and Sensational Sherri. Martel began her professional wrestling career as a manager. She joined the American Wrestling Association (AWA) in the mid-1980s and held its AWA World Women's Championship three times. In the late 1980s, she joined the World Wrestling Federation (WWF), where she held the WWF Women's Championship. Also in the WWF, Martel continued to act as a manager to wrestlers such as Randy Savage, Ted DiBiase, and Shawn Michaels. She appeared in Extreme Championship Wrestling (ECW) and World Championship Wrestling (WCW) in the 1990s. In the latter, Martel acted as the manager for the tag team Harlem Heat. After leaving WCW, she made a few wrestling related appearances until her death in 2007.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":60,"storytelling":68,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":72,"matchLayout":70,"psychology":60,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":7,"technicalCoaching":0,"characterCoaching":44,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":28,"mediaHandling":44,"brandBuilding":0,"socialMediaSavvy":48,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":0,"reactionSpeed":7,"consistency":15,"awareness":60,"judgement":36}},{"id":1898,"name":"Yokozuna","realName":"Yokozuna","picture":"Yokozuna.jpg","ability":27,"currentAbility":29,"potentialAbility":29,"charisma":39,"micSkills":25,"popularity":0,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":32,"injuryProne":0,"type":"wrestler","style":"all rounder","gender":"M","weight":289,"height":190,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1966-10-02T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1984-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":true,"story":"Rodney Agatupu Anoa'i was a Samoan American professional wrestler. He was best known for his time with the World Wrestling Federation (WWF) where he wrestled under the ring name Yokozuna. The term yokozuna refers to the highest rank in professional sumo wrestling in Japan. Although the \"Yokozuna\" character was portrayed as a champion sumo wrestler, Anoa?i never competed as an actual sumotori. Though Yokozuna wrestled as a representative of Japan, in real life Anoa?i was Samoan American and was accordingly billed as hailing from Polynesia. However, he was managed by the Japanese character Mr. Fuji (in reality a Japanese American), who would follow Anoa?i to the ring with a wooden bucket of salt, and waving a Japanese flag.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":60,"storytelling":63,"productFit":70,"riskTaking":40,"matchLayout":64,"psychology":60,"workerManagement":70,"trainingIntensity":0,"technicalCoaching":0,"characterCoaching":56,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":60,"mediaHandling":56,"brandBuilding":0,"socialMediaSavvy":47,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":14,"reactionSpeed":0,"consistency":40,"awareness":60,"judgement":64}},{"id":1899,"name":"Trent Seven","realName":"Trent Seven","picture":"Trent Seven.jpg","ability":63,"currentAbility":64,"potentialAbility":64,"charisma":51,"micSkills":71,"popularity":15,"condition":93,"hardcoreAbility":53,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":95,"height":175,"base":"UK","birthplace":"England","dateOfBirth":"1981-09-18T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2009-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Distinguished yet dangerous, Trent Seven is like a character from the underworld of a Guy Ritchie film. His debonair appearance and charming manner of speech belie his gritty, hard-nosed approach to the ring. It’s that same competitive spirit that made Seven one of the United Kingdom’s top grapplers in the first place.\r\n\r\nAfter spending years collecting titles in the British independent scene, Seven landed on the radar of the WWE Universe during the WWE UK Championship Tournament in January 2017. Though he fell short of claiming the UK crown, The Don’s intelligent, hard-hitting offense made everyone take notice. A bastion of British Strong Style — an exciting, post-modern take on classic English wrestling traditions — Seven has since made frequent appearances in NXT, often teaming with fellow British Strong Style proponent Tyler Bate as Moustache Mountain.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":48,"teams":[966,967,1237,1238,1846,2062,2195,3855],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":63,"storytelling":68,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":28,"matchLayout":69,"psychology":63,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":76,"technicalCoaching":62,"characterCoaching":68,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":72,"mediaHandling":68,"brandBuilding":46,"socialMediaSavvy":61,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":76,"consistency":75,"awareness":63,"judgement":78},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1899","wrestlerId":1899,"promotionId":48,"startDate":"2023-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":1900,"name":"Tyler Bate","realName":"Tyler Bate","picture":"Tyler Bate.jpg","ability":71,"currentAbility":71,"potentialAbility":71,"charisma":83,"micSkills":75,"popularity":38,"condition":95,"hardcoreAbility":86,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":79,"height":167,"base":"UK","birthplace":"England","dateOfBirth":"1997-03-07T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2012-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"fair","prestige":"low","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"The first-ever United Kingdom Champion has made his way to NXT UK, ready to take his already prestigious career to the next level against to top Superstars from the UK and Ireland. Translation, the NXT UK locker room should definitely be concerned.\r\n\r\nWith experience in promotions like Fight Club Pro, PROGRESS and Chikara, Tyler Bate, who hails from Dudley, England, spent his formative years inside the ring inspired by one of the more eclectic groups you’ll ever hear - Johnny Saint, Steve Grey and The Big Red Monster, Kane.\r\n\r\nBate honed his craft while earning his daily quid as a forklift operator to pay the bills. A technically sound wrestler who prefers things fair but isn’t afraid to get down and dirty, Textbook Tyler fought his way through four opponents in the WWE United Kingdom Championship Tournament in 2017 — including the vicious Pete Dunne in the Finals — to become the first WWE United Kingdom Champion at age 19. And if he made history as a teenager, imagine what the fu","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":64,"teams":[790,1237,1238,1846,2062,2195,3885,4370],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":74,"storytelling":77,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":20,"matchLayout":78,"psychology":74,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":86,"technicalCoaching":76,"characterCoaching":62,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":80,"mediaHandling":62,"brandBuilding":56,"socialMediaSavvy":57,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":86,"consistency":70,"awareness":74,"judgement":84},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-1900","wrestlerId":1900,"promotionId":64,"startDate":"2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":4333,"type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":4333},{"id":1901,"name":"Stephen Amell","realName":"Stephen Amell","picture":"Stephen Amell.jpg","ability":42,"currentAbil