,"birthplace":"Wales","dateOfBirth":"1990-04-13T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2009-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Welsh competitor Flash Morgan Webster enjoys being the center of attention. Known as The MODfather of Professional Wrestling for his ’60s British style, Webster is hard to miss, and once you’ve seen him in the ring, he’s hard to forget.\r\n\r\nWebster has made aerial maneuvers his stock-in-trade, but in the fine tradition of British wrestling, he’s highly skilled in grappling, too.\r\n\r\nAfter appearing in WWE in 2016 for a Cruiserweight Classic qualifying match and the 2018 WWE UK Championship Tournament, Webster solidified himself as a force to be reckoned with when he captured the NXT UK Tag Team Championships with Mark Andrews at NXT UK TakeOver: Cardiff.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[792,1801,1849,2357,3734,3930,3931],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":48,"storytelling":56,"productFit":88,"riskTaking":36,"matchLayout":58,"psychology":48,"workerManagement":88,"trainingIntensity":84,"technicalCoaching":51,"characterCoaching":53,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":64,"mediaHandling":53,"brandBuilding":29,"socialMediaSavvy":36,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":18,"reactionSpeed":84,"consistency":76,"awareness":48,"judgement":64}},{"id":2110,"name":"Zack Gibson","realName":"Zack Gibson","picture":"Zack Gibson.jpg","ability":55,"currentAbility":65,"potentialAbility":65,"charisma":79,"micSkills":60,"popularity":21,"condition":92,"hardcoreAbility":75,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":100,"height":187,"base":"UK","birthplace":"England","dateOfBirth":"1990-08-08T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2009-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"poor","prestige":"low","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Zack Gibson is willing to do whatever it takes to get the win, which makes him a truly dangerous competitor. He prefers straightforward rugged substance over flash, and he enjoys telling fans exactly what he thinks of them — a trait that has led to him becoming one of the U.K.’s most despised grapplers. Gibson also proudly embodies his local Liverpool heritage: From being an ardent proponent of “Scouse Style” (Scouse being a Liverpool dialect), to naming his prized wrist-lock after the Anfield football stadium’s iconic Shankly Gates, Gibson considers himself “Liverpool’s No. 1.”","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":49,"teams":[686,1854,2061,2205,2358,3932,3933,3934,3935,3957,4035,4075,4077,4176],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":69,"storytelling":71,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":22,"matchLayout":72,"psychology":69,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":82,"technicalCoaching":71,"characterCoaching":65,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":78,"mediaHandling":65,"brandBuilding":37,"socialMediaSavvy":62,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":82,"consistency":82,"awareness":69,"judgement":81},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2110","wrestlerId":2110,"promotionId":49,"startDate":"2024-11-07T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-11-07T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-11-07T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"inDevelopment":true},{"id":2111,"name":"WALTER","realName":"WALTER","picture":"WALTER.jpg","ability":81,"currentAbility":78,"potentialAbility":78,"charisma":91,"micSkills":75,"popularity":67,"condition":85,"hardcoreAbility":65,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"striker","gender":"M","weight":113,"height":190,"base":"Germany","birthplace":"Germany","dateOfBirth":"1987-08-20T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2005-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"great","prestige":"mid","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"WALTER is an Austrian wrestler who works in the USA, Canada, the British Isles, Japan, Europe and Oceania. He is a 6'4\", 250lb worker who is classed as using a Brawler style. He uses the Folding Powerbomb, the Lariat and the Rear Naked Choke as his finishers. He is best known for his work with WWE, NXT, PWG, NXT UK, wXw, BJW, RevPro, GCW, ZERO1, Beyond, EVOLVE, PROGRESS, FCP, OTT, Riptide and Defiant. He is married to Jinny.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":64,"teams":[799,1296,1799,2849],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":85,"storytelling":86,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":13,"matchLayout":86,"psychology":85,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":90,"technicalCoaching":63,"characterCoaching":73,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":87,"mediaHandling":73,"brandBuilding":76,"socialMediaSavvy":65,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":90,"consistency":93,"awareness":85,"judgement":91},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2111","wrestlerId":2111,"promotionId":64,"startDate":"2019-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":4333,"type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":4333},{"id":2112,"name":"Mitsuharu Misawa","realName":"Mitsuharu Misawa","picture":"Mitsuharu Misawa.jpg","ability":0,"currentAbility":0,"potentialAbility":0,"charisma":12,"micSkills":1,"popularity":10,"condition":52,"hardcoreAbility":19,"injuryProne":0,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":56,"height":160,"base":"Japan","birthplace":"Japan","dateOfBirth":"1962-06-18T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1981-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":true,"story":"Mitsuharu Misawa was a Japanese professional wrestler. He made his professional debut on August 21, 1981 for All Japan Pro Wrestling (AJPW). From 1984 until 1990, Misawa wrestled as the second generation Tiger Mask, as AJPW had purchased the rights of the Tiger Mask gimmick from New Japan Pro Wrestling (NJPW). Following the death of AJPW head booker Giant Baba in 1999, Misawa inherited the position of AJPW president. After being removed as president by a board of executives, Misawa left AJPW in May 2000 to form Pro Wrestling Noah (Noah). Misawa was an eight time world champion in Japanese promotions, having won the Triple Crown Heavyweight Championship five times and the GHC Heavyweight Championship three times, additionally being the inaugural holder of the latter championship. His impact was also recognized by critics, as he was also named Wrestler of the Year by Wrestling Observer Newsletter on three occasions.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[3064,3065,3217,3253],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":0,"storytelling":0,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":100,"matchLayout":0,"psychology":0,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":0,"technicalCoaching":0,"characterCoaching":0,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":0,"mediaHandling":0,"brandBuilding":0,"socialMediaSavvy":0,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":0,"reactionSpeed":0,"consistency":0,"awareness":0,"judgement":0}},{"id":2113,"name":"Chris Dickinson","realName":"Chris Dickinson","picture":"Chris Dickinson.jpg","ability":64,"currentAbility":67,"potentialAbility":67,"charisma":66,"micSkills":60,"popularity":7,"condition":83,"hardcoreAbility":60,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"all rounder","gender":"M","weight":107,"height":175,"base":"USA","birthplace":"