T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1996-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"La Comandante began her career working under the ring name La Nazi (The Nazi), inspired by El Nazi, a hated Mexican rudo. Her early days as a professional wrestler was tough, she was met with a lot of resistance with people complaining that she was too rough in the ring, not protecting her opponents enough while wrestling. Her reputation for working \"stiff\", as it is called in wrestling, made it so hard for her to get work that she retired in the late 1990s. She did not return to full-time wrestling until she met wrestler Pierroth, Jr. who helped her improve in the ring and get regular work as well.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":11,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":55,"storytelling":59,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":37,"matchLayout":60,"psychology":55,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":56,"technicalCoaching":44,"characterCoaching":56,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":63,"mediaHandling":56,"brandBuilding":31,"socialMediaSavvy":47,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":56,"consistency":64,"awareness":55,"judgement":73},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2209","wrestlerId":2209,"promotionId":11,"startDate":"2005-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":2210,"name":"La Seductora","realName":"La Seductora","picture":"La Seductora.jpg","ability":60,"currentAbility":53,"potentialAbility":53,"charisma":61,"micSkills":54,"popularity":4,"condition":68,"hardcoreAbility":46,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"all rounder","gender":"F","weight":63,"height":160,"base":"Mexico","birthplace":"Mexico","dateOfBirth":"1973-10-20T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1992-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"Irene Lagunas s a Mexican luchadora better known under the ring name La Seductora. The woman known as \"La Seductora\" began training for a professional wrestling career in 1992 under Chico Hernández, who also coined the ring name \"La Seductora\", to go with her personality of being both charming and evil in the ring. Her career was put on hold for a number of years to have children, but once her two girls were old enough she returned to the ring, competing for Consejo Mundial de Lucha Libre (CMLL).","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":58,"storytelling":63,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":23,"matchLayout":65,"psychology":58,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":62,"technicalCoaching":47,"characterCoaching":47,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":77,"mediaHandling":47,"brandBuilding":38,"socialMediaSavvy":40,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":62,"consistency":71,"awareness":58,"judgement":75}},{"id":2211,"name":"La Vaquerita","realName":"La Vaquerita","picture":"Vaquerita.jpg","ability":57,"currentAbility":55,"potentialAbility":55,"charisma":63,"micSkills":67,"popularity":3,"condition":73,"hardcoreAbility":72,"injuryProne":100,"type":"referee","style":"high flyer","gender":"F","weight":56,"height":152,"base":"Mexico","birthplace":"Mexico","dateOfBirth":"1978-05-16T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1993-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"La Vaquerita is the ring name of a Mexican luchadora enmascarada  currently working for the Mexican professional wrestling promotion CMLL. She was the first holder of the Lucha POP Women's Championship and made her debut for CMLL in late 2012. La Vaquerita became interested in lucha libre by pure chance, passing by Arena Coliseo in her native Guadalajara, Jalisco she noticed that they had female wrestlers on the card and became interested. She went to renowned wrestling trainer Diablo Velasco who lived in Guadalajara and got accepted into his wrestling school. According to Vaquerita she was the last female wrestler to be trained by Diablo Velasco before he retired in 1997.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":11,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":65,"storytelling":69,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":26,"matchLayout":70,"psychology":65,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":65,"technicalCoaching":54,"characterCoaching":44,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":74,"mediaHandling":44,"brandBuilding":49,"socialMediaSavvy":34,"ruleKnowledge":55,"positioning":64,"reactionSpeed":65,"consistency":62,"awareness":65,"judgement":79},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2211","wrestlerId":2211,"promotionId":11,"startDate":"2013-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":2213,"name":"Estrella Divina","realName":"Estrella Divina","picture":"Estrella Divina.jpg","ability":54,"currentAbility":53,"potentialAbility":53,"charisma":47,"micSkills":62,"popularity":4,"condition":93,"hardcoreAbility":58,"injuryProne":96,"type":"wrestler","style":"powerhouse","gender":"M","weight":66,"height":177,"base":"Mexico","birthplace":"Mexico","dateOfBirth":"1994-09-20T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2011-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Estrella Divina is a Mexican luchadora who works exclusively in Mexico. She is a Small worker who is classed as using a Entertainer style. She is best known for her work with IWRG.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":30,"teams":[1888],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":54,"storytelling":58,"productFit":56,"riskTaking":22,"matchLayout":60,"psychology":54,"workerManagement":56,"trainingIntensity":75,"technicalCoaching":61,"characterCoaching":76,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":78,"mediaHandling":76,"brandBuilding":46,"socialMediaSavvy":56,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":11,"reactionSpeed":75,"consistency":79,"awareness":54,"judgement":55},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2213","wrestlerId":2213,"promotionId":30,"startDate":"2023-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":2214,"name":"Villano IV","realName":"Villano IV","picture":"Villano IV.jpg","ability":69,"currentAbility":60,"potentialAbility":60,"charisma":55,"micSkills":54,"popularity":6,"condition":68,"hardcoreAbility":56,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":95,"height":172,"base":"Mexico","birthplace":"Mexico","dateOfBirth":"1965-04-05T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1979-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Tomas Díaz Mendoza is a Mexican professional wrestler, better known by his ring name Villano IV. Within the stable Los Villanos, he has wrestled for Universal Wrestling Association (UWA), Asistencia Asesoría y Administración (AAA), and World Championship Wrestling (WCW). While popular and successful in Mexico, he frequently performed as a jobber in WCW. Tomas Mendoza began wrestling in 1982 after being taught by his father and his older brother Arturo. He was not given the Villano name on his debut, both his father and his older brothers wanted him to get a college degree and also earn some in ring experience before he would be allowed to use the Villano name.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":60,"storytelling":70,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":29,"matchLayout":73,"psychology":60,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":53,"technicalCoaching":54,"characterCoaching":56,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":71,"mediaHandling":56,"brandBuilding":33,"socialMediaSavvy":29,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":53,"consistency":77,"awareness":60,"judgement":76}},{"id":2215,"name":"Villano V","realName":"Villano V","picture":"Villano V.jpg","ability":90,"currentAbility":88,"potentialAbility":88,"charisma":91,"micSkills":99,"popularity":4,"condition":51,"hardcoreAbility":93,"injuryProne":87,"type":"writer","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":100,"height":175,"base":"Mexico","birthplace":"Mexico","dateOfBirth":"1962-03-22T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1977-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":true,"story":"Raymundo Mendoza Jr. is the son of Ray Mendoza, a well known Mexican wrestler and wrestling trainer and the brother of Villano I (José de Jesús Díaz Mendoza), Villano II (José Alfredo Díaz Mendoza), Villano III (Arturo Díaz Mendoza), and Villano IV (Thomas Mendoza). Trained by his father and oldest brother, he was not allowed to use the Villano name until he finished his education. Because his younger brother finished his degree faster than Raymundo Mendoza Jr., he is known as \"V\" or 5 even though he is the fourth son of Ray Mendoza.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":75,"storytelling":79,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":24,"matchLayout":80,"psychology":75,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":18,"technicalCoaching":43,"characterCoaching":55,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":76,"mediaHandling":55,"brandBuilding":31,"socialMediaSavvy":47,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":18,"consistency":31,"awareness":75,"judgement":85}},{"id":2217,"name":"Zodiak","realName":"Zodiak","picture":"Zodiak.jpg","ability":47,"currentAbility":47,"potentialAbility":47,"charisma":50,"micSkills":59,"popularity":0,"condition":84,"hardcoreAbility":54,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"striker","gender":"M","weight":123,"height":185,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1977-04-20T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1998-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Zodiak is a masked American wrestler who works exclusively in America. He is a Heavyweight who is classed as using a Brawler style. He is one half of The Bomb Shelter alongside Joseph Schwartz. He is best known for his work with IWA-MS.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":45,"storytelling":54,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":52,"matchLayout":57,"psychology":45,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":64,"technicalCoaching":22,"characterCoaching":55,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":48,"mediaHandling":55,"brandBuilding":38,"socialMediaSavvy":44,"ruleKnowl