ultra-exclusive Knightsbridge district, Jinny is as comfortable modeling this season’s trendiest haute couture on the runway as she is exchanging forearm smashes inside the ring. The first female graduate of PROGRESS Wrestling’s school, Jinny has stolen the spotlight in promotions across the United Kingdom for years now.\r\n\r\nKnown for her aggressive style and domineering attitude, Jinny likes to impose her will on opponents, as WWE fans saw when she stepped in a WWE ring for the first time during 2017’s WrestleMania Axxess. Armed with a powerful offense that includes a middle-rope X-Factor and a ripcord clothesline, Jinny will not rest until she captures the NXT UK Women's Championship.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[2589],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":46,"storytelling":51,"productFit":45,"riskTaking":31,"matchLayout":53,"psychology":46,"workerManagement":45,"trainingIntensity":64,"technicalCoaching":40,"characterCoaching":64,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":69,"mediaHandling":64,"brandBuilding":59,"socialMediaSavvy":56,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":9,"reactionSpeed":64,"consistency":64,"awareness":46,"judgement":46}},{"id":2238,"name":"Marshe Rockett","realName":"Marshe Rockett","picture":"Marshe Rockett.jpg","ability":64,"currentAbility":59,"potentialAbility":59,"charisma":48,"micSkills":46,"popularity":4,"condition":88,"hardcoreAbility":63,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":125,"height":190,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1985-01-05T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2006-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Marshe Rockett is an American wrestler who works exclusively in North America. He is a Middleweight who is classed as us