ed out on the 2012 relaunch of Women of Wrestling as La Niña, one-half of the tag team \"Tropical Storm\" before becoming the ring announcer for Lucha Underground. She is currently working for IMPACT as an interviewer and hosts their Twitch shows. She is married to Brian Cage.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":76,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":28,"storytelling":33,"productFit":1,"riskTaking":37,"matchLayout":35,"psychology":28,"workerManagement":1,"trainingIntensity":56,"technicalCoaching":22,"characterCoaching":73,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":63,"mediaHandling":73,"brandBuilding":58,"socialMediaSavvy":65,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":0,"reactionSpeed":56,"consistency":54,"awareness":28,"judgement":17},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2249","wrestlerId":2249,"promotionId":76,"startDate":"2024-07-23T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-07-23T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-07-23T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":2250,"name":"Ryan Katz","realName":"Ryan Katz","picture":"Ryan Katz.jpg","ability":87,"currentAbility":79,"potentialAbility":79,"charisma":78,"micSkills":80,"popularity":0,"condition":74,"hardcoreAbility":76,"injuryProne":93,"type":"writer","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":67,"height":162,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1976-10-14T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1999-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"Ryan Smiley Katz is a retired professional wrestler, promoter and manager signed to WWE as a producer (what WWE refer to their Road Agents as being). Katz is best known in Xtreme Pro Wrestling under the ring name GQ Money as the manager of Kaos of The Enterprise. Altho