1","wrestlerId":2541,"promotionId":76,"startDate":"2025-05-14T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":2542,"name":"HT Drake","realName":"HT Drake","picture":"HT Drake.jpg","ability":47,"currentAbility":54,"potentialAbility":54,"charisma":54,"micSkills":62,"popularity":1,"condition":93,"hardcoreAbility":60,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":92,"height":170,"base":"UK","birthplace":"England","dateOfBirth":"1991-06-09T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2009-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"HT Drake, a 2009 graduate of the NGW Academy, is an English wrestler who works exclusively in the British Isles. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Regular style. He is best known for his work with NORTH.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":55,"storytelling":58,"productFit":71,"riskTaking":28,"matchLayout":59,"psychology":55,"workerManagement":71,"trainingIntensity":68,"technicalCoaching":58,"characterCoaching":34,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":72,"mediaHandling":34,"brandBuilding":37,"socialMediaSavvy":37,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":14,"reactionSpeed":68,"consistency":60,"awareness":55,"judgement":61}},{"id":2544,"name":"James R. Kennedy","realName":"James R. Kennedy","picture":"James R Kennedy.jpg","ability":30,"currentAbility":38,"potentialAbility":38,"charisma":40,"micSkills":35,"popularity":0,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":18,"injuryProne":100,"type":"commentator","style":"all rounder","gender":"M","weight":82,"height":180,"base":"UK","birthplace":"England","dateOfBirth":"1985-01-18T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2010-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"From the ashes of the former 'Sports Agent To The Stars', has risen a very different James R. Kennedy. Once the figure-head of the Kennedy Administration, the eccentric manager looked to change ICW into his family-friendly vision of what it could become. However, after losing control over the talents in his employ, Kennedy's outlook changed dramatically, and he has now amassed the violent firm known simply as The 55. The mastermind behind this dangerous collective, Kennedy is now set on total dominance over the rest of the ICW roster, and he will stop at nothing until he sits atop the mountain in Insane Championship Wrestling. Darker, and more focused than ever before, James R. Kennedy's brilliant mind poses a very real threat to the stability of ICW, meaning everyone had best be on constant alert.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":0,"storytelling":0,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":100,"matchLayout":0,"psychology":0,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":0,"technicalCoaching":0,"characterCoaching":59,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":0,"mediaHandling":59,"brandBuilding":48,"socialMediaSavvy":57,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":0,"reactionSpeed":0,"consistency":0,"awareness":0,"judgement":0}},{"id":2546,"name":"Prince Ameen","realName":"Prince Ameen","picture":"Prince Ameen.jpg","ability":48,"currentAbility":51,"potentialAbility":51,"charisma":66,"micSkills":48,"popularity":1,"condition":90,"hardcoreAbility":32,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"comedy","gender":"M","weight":106,"height":185,"base":"UK","birthplace":"England","dateOfBirth":"1984-01-08T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2002-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"You thought The Million Dollar Man was the richest man in wrestling? He’s practically a beggar next to Prince Ameen.Royalty from the ancient Indus Valley, Ameen is of impressive stock. He’s not showing his skills in the ring just to make a living; he already has enough to last him an eternity. Instead, he simply wants to prove to the world what India already knows: that’s he’s the very best.A noble upbringing doesn’t always result in a noble character, and though he claims to be the greatest grappler around, the Prince is never afraid to use some underhand tactics to get ahead. Sometimes there’s more in that turban than just his head…","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":60,"storytelling":62,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":34,"matchLayout":62,"psychology":60,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":72,"technicalCoaching":40,"characterCoaching":47,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":66,"mediaHandling":47,"brandBuilding":55,"socialMediaSavvy":47,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":72,"consistency":70,"awareness":60,"judgement":76}},{"id":2549,"name":"Ortiz","realName":"Ortiz","picture":"Angel Ortiz.jpg","ability":54,"currentAbility":63,"potentialAbility":63,"charisma":76,"micSkills":73,"popularity":29,"condition":91,"hardcoreAbility":68,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":87,"height":170,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1991-09-27T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"poor","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Ortiz is an American wrestler 