 Tag Team Championship three months later. In June 2007, he was drafted to the SmackDown! brand, but was released from his WWE contract in November 2008. He later began working on the independent circuit, wrestling for promotions including Dragon Gate USA and Evolve.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":64,"teams":[1328,1908,2903,3214],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":63,"storytelling":66,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":21,"matchLayout":67,"psychology":63,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":67,"technicalCoaching":50,"characterCoaching":60,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":79,"mediaHandling":60,"brandBuilding":60,"socialMediaSavvy":52,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":67,"consistency":64,"awareness":63,"judgement":78},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2628","wrestlerId":2628,"promotionId":64,"startDate":"2021-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":4333,"type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":4333},{"id":2629,"name":"Laura Di Matteo","realName":"Laura Di Matteo","picture":"Laura Di Matteo.jpg","ability":50,"currentAbility":57,"potentialAbility":57,"charisma":60,"micSkills":65,"popularity":2,"condition":98,"hardcoreAbility":76,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"F","weight":46,"height":157,"base":"Europe","birthplace":"Italy","dateOfBirth":"1993-03-12T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2015-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"Laura Di Matteo is an Italian wrestler who works in the British Isles and Europe. She is a Very Small worker who is classed as using a Technician style. She is best known for her work with wXw, RevPro, GWF, PROGRESS and EVE. She is currently an EVE Tag Team champi