ed as using a Technician Flyer style. He is best known for his work with NOAH, Dragongate and AJPW. He is currently a GHC Junior Heavyweight Tag Team champion.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":45,"teams":[4120,4121],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":61,"storytelling":67,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":36,"matchLayout":69,"psychology":61,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":80,"technicalCoaching":62,"characterCoaching":76,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":64,"mediaHandling":76,"brandBuilding":62,"socialMediaSavvy":58,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":80,"consistency":78,"awareness":61,"judgement":77},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2642","wrestlerId":2642,"promotionId":45,"startDate":"2017-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":2643,"name":"Cinta de Oro","realName":"Cinta de Oro","picture":"Cinta de Oro.jpg","ability":52,"currentAbility":61,"potentialAbility":61,"charisma":47,"micSkills":65,"popularity":23,"condition":76,"hardcoreAbility":54,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":95,"height":175,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1977-09-05T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1999-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"poor","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Jorge Arias is a Mexican American professional wrestler. Prior to signing with WWE, Arias was better known under the ring name Incognito, under which he mainly worked for the professional wrestling promotion Asistencia Asesoría y Administración (AAA) in Mexico and Chikara in the US as well as working for various independent promoters along the US/Mexico border. Arias originally wrestled under the name \"Místico\", making his debut under that name around the same time as the much more well known Místico of Mexico City. At times he is billed as either \"Mystico\" or \"Mistico de Juarez\". In early 2004 he began working regularly for Asistencia Asesoría y Administración (AAA), CMLL's main Mexican rival and had to change his name in order to avoid any type of legal problems. With minor adjustments to his mask and tights Mystico became known as \"Incognito\" instead, adopting the name he is best known as today.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[1584,1585,1586,1587,3513],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":58,"storytelling":66,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":42,"matchLayout":68,"psychology":58,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":73,"technicalCoaching":54,"characterCoaching":55,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":58,"mediaHandling":55,"brandBuilding":57,"socialMediaSavvy":45,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":73,"consistency":70,"awareness":58,"judgement":75}},{"id":2644,"name":"Shawn Spears","realName":"Shawn Spears","picture":"Shawn Spears.jpg","ability":58,"currentAbility":66,"potentialAbility":66,"charisma":58,"micSkills":81,"popularity":30,"condition":86,"hardcoreAbility":73,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":101,"height":187,"base":"Canada","birthplace":"Canada","dateOfBirth":"1981-02-19T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2001-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"poor","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Shawn Spears is a Canadian wrestler who works in America and Canada. He is a Middleweight who is classed as using a Regular style. He is best known for his work with WWE, AEW, NXT and AJPW. He is married to Cassie Lee.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,