}},{"id":2812,"name":"Nate Carter","realName":"Nate Carter","picture":"Nate Carter.jpg","ability":61,"currentAbility":53,"potentialAbility":53,"charisma":48,"micSkills":55,"popularity":1,"condition":96,"hardcoreAbility":63,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":90,"height":170,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1989-01-19T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2011-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Nate Carter is an American wrestler who works exclusively in America. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Regular style. He is one half of Dub Boys alongside Dave McCall. He is best known for his work with CZW. He is currently a CZW Tag Team champion.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[1677,1678,2129],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":46,"storytelling":53,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":22,"matchLayout":55,"psychology":46,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":78,"technicalCoaching":49,"characterCoaching":56,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":78,"mediaHandling":56,"brandBuilding":53,"socialMediaSavvy":45,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":0,"reactionSpeed":78,"consistency":75,"awareness":46,"judgement":28}},{"id":2813,"name":"Mad Kurt","realName":"Mad Kurt","picture":"Kurtis Chapman.jpg","ability":51,"currentAbility":53,"potentialAbility":53,"charisma":54,"micSkills":48,"popularity":2,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":43,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":57,"height":160,"base":"UK","birthplace":"England","dateOfBirth":"1997-12-19T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2014-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":true,"story":"Mad Kurt, a 2014 graduate of the Portsmouth School of Wrestling, was an English wrestler who has since passed away.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[2226],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":52,"storytelling":56,"productFit":58,"riskTaking":24,"matchLayout":57,"psychology":52,"workerManagement":58,"trainingIntensity":79,"technicalCoaching":56,"characterCoaching":69,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":76,"mediaHandling":69,"brandBuilding":30,"socialMediaSavvy":63,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":12,"reactionSpeed":79,"consistency":67,"awareness":52,"judgement":54}},{"id":2815,"name":"Shotzi Blackheart","realName":"Shotzi Blackheart","picture":"Shotzi Blackheart.jpg","ability":44,"currentAbility":44,"potentialAbility":44,"charisma":39,"micSkills":39,"popularity":34,"condition":86,"hardcoreAbility":30,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"F","weight":57,"height":165,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1992-03-14T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2015-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"poor","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"There’s no chance too big for Shotzi Blackheart to take, and that spells bad news for her opponents.\r\n\r\nMaking a name for herself for years on the independent scene with her death-defying style and unapologetic, in-your-face attitude, Blackheart racked up a number of championships and became a fan-favorite. \r\n\r\nShe arrived to NXT with a clear mission statement to take care of business. Indestructible and bad-to-the-bone, Blackheart rides to the ring on a tank, setting the tone for her matches: She won't get pushed around and her opponents will end up crushed.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":68,"teams":[2562,2783],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":41,"storytelling":45,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":40,"matchLayout":46,"psychology":41,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":65,"technicalCoaching":35,"characterCoaching":74,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":60,"mediaHandling":74,"brandBuilding":68,"socialMediaSavvy":56,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":65,"consistency":38,"awareness":41,"judgement":65},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2815","wrestlerId":2815,"promotionId":68,"startDate":"2025-06-26T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":2817,"name":"Austin Theory","realName":"Austin Theory","picture":"Austin Theory.jpg","ability":67,"currentAbility":61,"potentialAbility":61,"charisma":67,"micSkills":53,"popularity":40,"condition":90,"hardcoreAbility":47,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":100,"height":182,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1997-08-02T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2016-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"fair","prestige":"mid","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Some people just get it, and it didn’t take Austin Theory long to become the kind of Superstar who travels the world, racks up championships and finally makes it to WWE. In fact, he did it all before he was 23, in just a short but sweet four years.\r\n\r\nTheory is a study in rapid, meteoric ascent, appearing across Progress, EVOLVE and CMLL from 2017 to 2019, where he rubbed shoulders and threw hands with future NXT and WWE Superstars like Keith Lee, Lio Rush and Mark Andrews. In 2019, he defeated future NXT and NXT UK fixtures Roderick Strong and Fabian Aichner to win the EVOLVE Championship.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":64,"teams":[3827,4057],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":55,"storytelling":60,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":30,"matchLayout":62,"psychology":55,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":75,"technicalCoaching":55,"characterCoaching":58,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":70,"mediaHandling":58,"brandBuilding":73,"socialMediaSavvy":53,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":75,"consistency":63,"awareness":55,"judgement":73},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2817","wrestlerId":2817,"promotionId":64,"startDate":"2019-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":4333,"type":"exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":4333},{"id":2818,"name":"Owen Knight","realName":"Owen Knight","picture":"Owen Knight.jpg","ability":51,"currentAbility":50,"potentialAbility":50,"charisma":59,"micSkills":51,"popularity":0,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":55,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":86,"height":175,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1994-09-05T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2012-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Owen Knight is an American wrestler who works exclusively in America. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a High Flyer style.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":40,"storytelling":47,"productFit":42,"riskTaking":38,"matchLayout":49,"psychology":40,"workerManagement":42,"trainingIntensity":69,"technicalCoaching":53,"characterCoaching":56,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":62,"mediaHandling":56,"brandBuilding":43,"socialMediaSavvy":38,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":8,"reactionSpeed":69,"consistency":73,"awareness":40,"judgement":41}},{"id":2819,"name":"Glacier","realName":"Glacier","picture":"Glacier.jpg","ability":81,"currentAbility":81,"potentialAbility":81,"charisma":93,"micSkills":67,"popularity":5,"condition":79,"hardcoreAbility":81,"injuryProne":100,"type":"writer","style":"striker","gender":"M","weight":111,"height":185,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1964-05-13T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1987-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Raymond M. Lloyd is an American martial artist, professional wrestler, and actor. He is best known for his appearances with World Championship Wrestling from 1996 to 1999 under the ring name Glacier. Lloyd was born into a law-enforcement family in Brunswick, Georgia. Lloyd began his wrestling career shortly after graduation. He was trained by Georgia grappler Fred Avery in a makeshift ring set up in Avery's backyard, and then cut his teeth on the Georgia independent circuit for two years. Beginning in April 1996, Lloyd's new ring persona, Glacier, a gimmick similar to the Mortal Kombat character Sub-Zero, was introduced via a series of vignettes during WCW programming that featured the tagline Blood Runs Cold. Along with Dusty Rhodes, Lloyd co-founded Turnbuckle Championship Wrestling (TCW) in 2000, which held shows throughout the Southeast. He would make his return to a major wrestling promotion on August 26, 2017, when he entered at #20 in Ring of Honor's 2017 Honor Rumble.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":76,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":62,"storytelling":62,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":33,"matchLayout":62,"psychology":62,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":50,"technicalCoaching":30,"characterCoaching":42,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":67,"mediaHandling":42,"brandBuilding":45,"socialMediaSavvy":42,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":50,"consistency":56,"awareness":62,"judgement":77},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2819","wrestlerId":2819,"promotionId":76,"startDate":"2024-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":2820,"name":"Arkalis","realName":"Arkalis","picture":"Arkalis.jpg","ability":55,"currentAbility":48,"potentialAbility":48,"charisma":37,"micSkills":50,"popularity":3,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":51,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":94,"height":165,"base":"Mexico","birthplace":"Mexico","dateOfBirth":"1990-07-14T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2008-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Arkalis is a masked Mexican luchador who works exclusively in Mexico. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Luchador style. His father also wrestled under the name Blue Man.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":11,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":48,"storytelling":54,"productFit":54,"riskTaking":28,"matchLayout":56,"psychology":48,"workerManagement":54,"trainingIntensity":78,"technicalCoaching":53,"characterCoaching":53,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":72,"mediaHandling":53,"brandBuilding":48,"socialMediaSavvy":38,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":11,"reactionSpeed":78,"consistency":70,"awareness":48,"judgement":50},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-2820","wrestlerId":2820,"promotionId":11,"startDate":"2014-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":2823,"name":"Tiger Ruas","realName":"Tiger Ruas","picture":"Adrian Jaoude.jpg","ability":58,"currentAbility":58,"potentialAbility":58,"charisma":45,"micSkills":59,"popularity":3,"condition":86,"hardcoreAbility":57,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"submission","gender":"M","weight":100,"height":177,"base":"Other","birthplace":"Brazil","dateOfBirth":"1981-10-11T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2016-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":true,"dead":false,"story":"Arturo Ruas has all but perfected the technique of grappling. That’s what happens when one spends an entire lifetime in the fighting game. Although Ruas never competed inside the squared circle before joining the WWE Performance Center in 2016, his vast experience in practically every other combat sport made him a can’t-miss prospect to NXT scouts and officials. For 17 years, Ruas was an unbeaten freestyle wrestling champion in his home country of Brazil. He’s a black belt in jiu-jitsu, well-versed in capoeira (a traditional form of Brazilian fighting) and hails from a legendary family of Aikido martial artists, making him one of the most dangerously skilled individuals walking the earth.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[2545,2546],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":43,"storytelling":49,"productFit":36,"riskTaking":30,"matchLayout":51,"psychology":43,"workerManagement":36,"trainingIntensity":74,"technicalCoaching":69,"characterCoaching":38,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":70,"mediaHandling":38,"brandBuilding":67,"socialMediaSavvy":29,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":7,"reactionSpeed":74,"consistency":67,"awareness":43,"judgement":40}},{"id":2826,"name":"Gorilla Monsoon","realName":"Gorilla Monsoon","picture":"Gorilla Monsoon.jpg","ability":0,"currentAbility":0,"potentialAbility":0,"charisma":0,"micSkills":10,"popularity":0,"condition":0,"hardcoreAbility":0,"injuryProne":0,"type":"wrestler","style":"all rounder","gender":"M","weight":181,"height":195,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1937-06-04T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1959-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":true,"story":"Robert James Marella, better known by his ring name of Gorilla Monsoon, was an American professional wrestler, play-by-play commentator, and booker. Monsoon is famous for his run as a super-heavyweight main eventer, and later as the voice of the World Wrestling Federation, as commentator and backstage manager during the 1980s and 1990s. He also portrayed the on-screen role of WWF President from 1995 to 1997. In professional wrestling, the staging area just behind the entrance curtain at an event, a position which Marella established and where he could often be found during WWF shows late in his career, is named the \"Gorilla Position\" in his honor. Although remembered fondly by many viewers, Monsoon was voted Worst Television Announcer a record six times by readers of the Wrestling Observer Newsletter in the publication's annual awards poll.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":0,"storytelling":0,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":100,"matchLayout":0,"psychology":0,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":0,"technicalCoaching":0,"characterCoaching":0,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":0,"mediaHandling":0,"brandBuilding":0,"socialMedi