 Kato returned to the ring in October 2006, following the folding of Gaea Japan, and found a new home in the Oz Academy promotion.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[1710,1712,2842,2843],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":72,"storytelling":76,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":22,"matchLayout":77,"psychology":72,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":73,"technicalCoaching":69,"characterCoaching":51,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":78,"mediaHandling":51,"brandBuilding":45,"socialMediaSavvy":33,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":73,"consistency":67,"awareness":72,"judgement":83}},{"id":2870,"name":"Rin Kadokura","realName":"Rin Kadokura","picture":"Rin Kadokura.jpg","ability":64,"currentAbility":54,"potentialAbility":54,"charisma":56,"micSkills":52,"popularity":2,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":72,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"F","weight":54,"height":152,"base":"Japan","birthplace":"Japan","dateOfBirth":"1993-02-27T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2016-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Rin Kadokura is a Japanese wrestler who works exclusively in Japan. She is a Small worker who is classed as using a Technician style. She is one half of NEW-TRA alongside Takumi Iroha. She is best known for her work with AEW, Stardom, ZERO1, Sendai Girls, SEAdLINNNG and Marvelous. She is married to someone outside the wrestling business. She is the protege of Chigusa Nagayo.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":78,"teams":[1701,2481,3011,3353,3425,3426],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":56,"storytelling":61,"productFit":50,"riskTaking":28,"matchLayout":