ge":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Carlos Romo is a Spanish wrestler who works in America, the British Isles and Europe. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a High Flyer style. He is best known for his work with RevPro, Beyond, NORTH, OTT, DEFY, ATTACK! and Riptide.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[1747,1748,3126,3127,3128,3129],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":52,"storytelling":57,"productFit":53,"riskTaking":31,"matchLayout":59,"psychology":52,"workerManagement":53,"trainingIntensity":82,"technicalCoaching":57,"characterCoaching":64,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":69,"mediaHandling":64,"brandBuilding":42,"socialMediaSavvy":42,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":11,"reactionSpeed":82,"consistency":71,"awareness":52,"judgement":52}},{"id":2955,"name":"A-Kid","realName":"A-Kid","picture":"A-Kid.jpg","ability":59,"currentAbility":63,"potentialAbility":63,"charisma":72,"micSkills":70,"popularity":30,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":70,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":70,"height":170,"base":"Europe","birthplace":"Spain","dateOfBirth":"1997-05-09T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2012-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"poor","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Since emerging on the NXT UK scene, Spanish Superstar A-Kid has quickly captured the interest of the WWE Universe as well as prominent competitors like the first-ever United Kingdom Champion, Tyler Bate. Win or lose, the up-and-comer has wasted little time bringing the fight to a number of high-profile opponents that include Kassius Ohno, Jordan Devlin and Bate himself.\r\n\r\nHailing from one of the hardest-working neighborhoods of Madrid, A-Kid takes pride in representing