mpionships before taking her craft to the United States and eventually signing with WWE and joining the Performance Center. In short order, Hartwell has demonstrated that she possesses what it takes to be a major player for years to come, competing against some of the black-and-gold brand’s best. In what may prove to be a pivotal move for her trajectory, Hartwell worked to win the favor of veteran Candice LeRae in sometimes dastardly fashion, with The Poison Pixie eventually taking the younger prospect under her wing.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":28,"teams":[2330,2623,2827,2828,2829],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":43,"storytelling":47,"productFit":45,"riskTaking":33,"matchLayout":48,"psychology":43,"workerManagement":45,"trainingIntensity":66,"technicalCoaching":46,"characterCoaching":72,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":67,"mediaHandling":72,"brandBuilding":71,"socialMediaSavvy":69,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":9,"reactionSpeed":66,"consistency":61,"awareness":43,"judgement":44},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-3075","wrestlerId":3075,"promotionId":28,"startDate":"2025-04-28T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":3076,"name":"Lady Flammer","realName":"Lady Flammer","picture":"Lady Flammer.jpg","ability":54,"currentAbility":53,"potentialAbility":53,"charisma":53,"micSkills":59,"popularity":5,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":45,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"F","weight":59,"height":154,"base":"Mexico","birthplace":"Mexico","dateOfBirth":"1999-11-09T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2009-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":true,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Lady Flammer is a masked Mexican luchadora who works in America and Mexico. She is a Small worker who is classed as using a Luchador style. She is best known for her work with AAA, NWA, MLW, The Crash and NLL. She is currently an AAA World Mixed Tag Team champion. She is married to The Tiger.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":5,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":54,"storytelling":59,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":32,"matchLayout":61,"psychology":54,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":69,"technicalCoaching":55,"characterCoaching":65,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":68,"mediaHandling":65,"brandBuilding":73,"socialMediaSavvy":43,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":69,"consistency":54,"awareness":54,"judgement":72},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-3076","wrestlerId":3076,"promotionId":5,"startDate":"2021-02-04T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":3077,"name":"Jessie Elaban","realName":"Jessie Elaban","picture":"Jessie Elaban.jpg","ability":42,"currentAbility":39,"potentialAbility":39,"charisma":44,"micSkills":38,"popularity":4,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":43,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"powerhouse","gender":"F","weight":69,"height":172,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1988-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2017-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Elaban was one of four children, and has two sisters Natasha and Kiana and a brother named Cody. Elaban graduated in 2007 from James Bowie High School in Austin, Texas where she played volleyball as a middle blocker and right-side for three seasons. She attended Concordia University Texas during 2010 where she played volleyball as a middle blocker and right-side. While in Concordia University Texas, Elaban majored in Communications. Elaban joined the WWE in 2017 and made her debut in NXT during the house show on October 7, in a battle royal won by Vanessa Borne. Two weeks later, Elaban wrestled in a Halloween Costume Battle Royal won by Shayna Baszler.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":35,"storytelling":39,"productFit":29,"riskTaking":40,"matchLayout":40,"psychology":35,"workerManagement":29,"trainingIntensity":62,"technicalCoaching":32,"characterCoaching":58,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":60,"mediaHandling":58,"brandBuilding":53,"socialMediaSavvy":46,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":6,"reactionSpeed":62,"consistency":50,"awareness":35,"judgement":33}},{"id":3078,"name":"Matt Gatlin","realName":"Matt Gatlin","picture":"ELIJAH.jpg","ability":58,"currentAbility":52,"potentialAbility":52,"charisma":63,"micSkills":62,"popularity":1,"condition":90,"hardcoreAbility":49,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":94,"height":170,"base":"UK","birthplace":"England","dateOfBirth":"1995-01-29T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2016-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"ELIJAH, a 2016 graduate of the Dragon Pro Academy, is an English wrestler who works exclusively in the British Isles. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Regular style. He is best known for his work with PROGRESS, ATTACK! and Riptide.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[2193,3480],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches"