 Veterans, giving them the experience to make sure they’re on the rise in WWE’s fastest-growing brand.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[2238,2845],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":52,"storytelling":57,"productFit":53,"riskTaking":26,"matchLayout":58,"psychology":52,"workerManagement":53,"trainingIntensity":72,"technicalCoaching":48,"characterCoaching":67,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":74,"mediaHandling":67,"brandBuilding":57,"socialMediaSavvy":57,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":11,"reactionSpeed":72,"consistency":75,"awareness":52,"judgement":52}},{"id":3104,"name":"Lewis Howley","realName":"Lewis Howley","picture":"Lewis Howley.jpg","ability":56,"currentAbility":54,"potentialAbility":54,"charisma":69,"micSkills":62,"popularity":26,"condition":98,"hardcoreAbility":52,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":78,"height":182,"base":"UK","birthplace":"England","dateOfBirth":"1997-05-21T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2015-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"poor","prestige":"low","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Are Pretty Deadly the fastest-rising tag team in NXT UK? YES, BOY!\r\n\r\nWhile Lewis Howley and his partner Sam Stoker may seem like they’re more concerned with their looks and fashion choices, Pretty Deadly have proven themselves to be a cunning tag team, willing to do whatever it takes to pick up a victory.  \r\n\r\nDon’t let their good looks fool you; Pretty Deadly will be wearing gold before you know it.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":64,"teams":[1963,2359,3482,3483,3725],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":55,"storytelling":59,"productFit":45,"riskTaking":27,"matchLayout":60,"psycholog