,"name":"Larry D","realName":"Larry D","picture":"Larry D.jpg","ability":46,"currentAbility":52,"potentialAbility":52,"charisma":50,"micSkills":41,"popularity":3,"condition":89,"hardcoreAbility":59,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"striker","gender":"M","weight":151,"height":180,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1984-01-25T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2002-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Larry D is an American wrestler who works exclusively in America. He is a Heavyweight who is classed as using a Brawler style. He is best known for his work with IWA:MS. He is married to someone outside the wrestling business.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[2049,2513,2514],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":62,"storytelling":64,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":32,"matchLayout":65,"psychology":62,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":56,"technicalCoaching":27,"characterCoaching":49,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":68,"mediaHandling":49,"brandBuilding":35,"socialMediaSavvy":38,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":56,"consistency":67,"awareness":62,"judgement":77}},{"id":3236,"name":"Máscara Año 2000","realName":"Máscara Año 2000","picture":"Mascara Ano 2000.jpg","ability":58,"currentAbility":65,"potentialAbility":65,"charisma":80,"micSkills":57,"popularity":5,"condition":55,"hardcoreAbility":53,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":97,"height":177,"base":"Mexico","birthplace":"Mexico","dateOfBirth":"1958-03-10T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"1977-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Máscara Año 2000 is a Mexican luchador who works exclusively in Mexico. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Luchador style. Making his debut in 1977, only a few years after his older brother, Cien Caras made his. Both brothers worked regularly for Empresa Mexicana de Lucha Libre (EMLL) from the early 1980s and they also brought in their younger brother who worked as Universo 2000 to form a trio billed as Los Hermanos Dinamita. In mid-1992 then CMLL booker Antonio Peña decided to break away from the promotion and form his own promotion called Asistencia Asesoría y Administración, wanting to produce his own style of wrestling shows that differed from the very conservative way CMLL ran things. Among the people that left CMLL to join AAA were Los Hermanos, who took the Mexican National Trios title with them. By mid-1996 Los Hermanos left AAA and returned to CMLL.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":75,"storytelling":80,"productFit":100,"riskTaking":31,"matchLayout":81,"psychology":75,"workerManagement":100,"trainingIntensity":51,"technicalCoaching":58,"characterCoaching":61,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":69,"mediaHandling":61,"brandBuilding":42,"socialMediaSavvy":57,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":20,"reactionSpeed":51,"consistency":64,"awareness":75,"judgement":85}},{"id":3237,"name":"Mason Madden","realName":"Mason Madden","picture":"Marcellus Black.jpg","ability":58,"currentAbility":54,"potentialAbility":54,"charisma":43,"micSkills":44,"popularity":28,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":38,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"powerhouse","gender":"M","weight":130,"height":200,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1991-02-05T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2016-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"poor","prestige":"low","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Brennan Williams is an American former professional football offensive tackle, professional wrestler and announcer who works exclusively in North America. He is a Heavyweight who is classed as using a Regular Wrestler style. While at Catholic Memorial, Williams was a member of PrepStar's High School All-America team, a member of the \"Super 26\" team in 2008, an all-scholastic by the Boston Globe and Boston Herald. The Houston Texans selected Williams in the third round with the 89th overall pick of the 2013 NFL Draft. On February 20, 2015, Williams was signed by the Jacksonville Jaguars, to a two-year contract. On October 20, 2015, the New England Patriots signed Williams to their practice squad. They waived him two days later. After being released by the Patriots, Williams returned to Houston to train to become a professional wrestler. Williams is the son of former NFL defensive end Brent Williams.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":49,"teams":[2460,2764,3796,3852,4223,4224,4225,4226,4227,4228,4332],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":48,"storytelling":52,"productFit":56,"riskTaking":27,"matchLayout":54,"psychology":48,"workerManagement":56,"trainingIntensity":69,"technicalCoaching":34,"characterCoaching":77,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":73,"mediaHandling":77,"brandBuilding":77,"socialMediaSavvy":63,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":11,"reactionSpeed":69,"consistency":66,"awareness":48,"judgement":51},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-3237","wrestlerId":3237,"promotionId":49,"startDate":"2024-07-26T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-07-26T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-07-26T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"inDevelopment":true},{"id":3238,"name":"Chyna","realName":"Chyna","picture":"Chyna.jpg","ability":0,"current