ed as using a Regular style. She uses the Bonnie-Voyage and the Samoan Drop as her finishers. She is best known for her work with NWA, EVOLVE and PROGRESS.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":79,"teams":[3859,3860],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":57,"storytelling":59,"productFit":48,"riskTaking":33,"matchLayout":60,"psychology":57,"workerManagement":48,"trainingIntensity":71,"technicalCoaching":47,"characterCoaching":56,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":67,"mediaHandling":56,"brandBuilding":65,"socialMediaSavvy":48,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":10,"reactionSpeed":71,"consistency":63,"awareness":57,"judgement":53},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-3267","wrestlerId":3267,"promotionId":79,"startDate":"2021-12-03T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":3268,"name":"Gisele Shaw","realName":"Gisele Shaw","picture":"Gisele Shaw.jpg","ability":62,"currentAbility":57,"potentialAbility":57,"charisma":48,"micSkills":63,"popularity":19,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":65,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":59,"height":167,"base":"Other","birthplace":"Unknown","dateOfBirth":"1988-10-30T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2015-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Gisele Shaw is a Filipino wrestler who works in the USA, Canada, the British Isles, Japan and Europe. She is a 5'7\", 130lb worker who is classed as using a Regular style. She uses the Chick Kick and the Eat Defeat as her finishers. She is best known for her work with TNA, TJPW, RevPro, MLP, PROGRESS, FCP, EVE, OTT, ATTACK! and Riptide. She is the protege of Lance Storm.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":118,"teams":[2220,2588],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":58,"storytelling":60,"productFit":70,"riskTaking":24,"matchLayout":61,"psychology":58,"workerManagement":70,"trainingIntensity":70,"technicalCoaching":56,"characterCoaching":58,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":76,"mediaHandling":58,"brandBuilding":73,"socialMediaSavvy":56,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":14,"reactionSpeed":70,"consistency":69,"awareness":58,"judgement":63},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-3268","wrestlerId":3268,"promotionId":118,"startDate":"2024-10-19T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-10-19T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-10-19T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":3269,"name":"Ridge Holland","realName":"Ridge Holland","picture":"Luke Menzies.jpg","ability":60,"currentAbility":54,"potentialAbility":54,"charisma":53,"micSkills":65,"popularity":23,"condition":91,"hardcoreAbility":51,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"powerhouse","gender":"M","weight":118,"height":182,"base":"UK","birthplace":"England","dateOfBirth":"1988-05-29T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2016-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"poor","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"What do you do if you’re deemed too dangerous and too reckless for the rough-and-tumble world of professional rugby? If you’re Ridge Holland, you move from the pitch to the ring and start busting skulls there instead.\r\n\r\nThat, in short, is how Holland wound up an NXT Superstar, although his fistic foray began well before he entered U.K.’s pro rugby ranks. Holland first developed a taste for fighting as a youngster in Yorkshire, and his appetite for destruction has only increased.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":46,"storytelling":51,"productFit":62,"riskTaking":52,"matchLayout":53,"psychology":46,"workerManagement":62,"trainingIntensity":73,"technicalCoaching":48,"characterCoaching":58,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":48,"mediaHandling":58,"brandBuilding":73,"socialMediaSavvy":48,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":12,"reactionSpeed":73,"consistency":65,"awareness":46,"judgement":52},"injury":{"type":"Broken Neck","daysToRecover":-5},"returnDate":"2026-04-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":3270,"name":"Leyton Buzzard","realName":"Leyton Buzzard","picture":"Leyton Buzzard.jpg","ability":50,"currentAbility":58,"potentialAbility":58,"charisma":66,"micSkills":67,"popularity":6,"condition":93,"hardcoreAbility":65,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"M","weight":94,"height":177,"base":"UK","birthplace":"England","dateOfBirth":"1997-09-14T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2017-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Leyton Buzzard is an English wrestler who works exclusively in the British Isles. He is a Lightweight who is classed as using a Entertainer style. From an early age, Leyton Buzzard was a confident and talented performer. But while his younger years were spent on the musical theatre stage, he’s now putting his talents to use in the wrestling ring. Once in the running to be cast as Oliver! on London’s West End in BBC talent show I’d Do Anything, the rising star in Scots-based Insane Championship Wrestling reckons his acting experience put him in good stead for his career in the ring.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":7,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAtt