":48,"judgement":40},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-3294","wrestlerId":3294,"promotionId":68,"startDate":"2024-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":3295,"name":"King Mo","realName":"King Mo","picture":"King Mo.jpg","ability":40,"currentAbility":49,"potentialAbility":49,"charisma":60,"micSkills":56,"popularity":6,"condition":83,"hardcoreAbility":32,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"submission","gender":"M","weight":93,"height":180,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1981-01-11T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2012-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"A former Strikeforce Light Heavyweight Champion and Rizin Heavyweight Grand Prix Champion, the 6' tall 217 pound fighter is a member of the prestigious American Top Team (“ATT”) under the guidance of Dan Lambert. No stranger to the sport of pro wrestling, King Mo is a lifelong fan making his pro wrestling debut in 2012. While flamboyant and outspoken, King Mo is to many the truest fighter of all. With 21 wins in MMA (13 by KO), the former NCAA Division 1 All American for Oklahoma State and Bellator fighter has exceptional qualifications and a record along with MMA championships to back it up. A world class athlete, Mo looks to make Major League Wrestling his kingdom for fighting.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":42,"storytelling":46,"productFit":5,"riskTaking":37,"matchLayout":47,"psychology":42,"workerManagement":5,"trainingIntensity":80,"technicalCoaching":44,"characterCoaching":64,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":63,"mediaHandling":64,"brandBuilding":76,"socialMediaSavvy":45,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":1,"reactionSpeed":80,"consistency":57,"awareness":42,"judgement":27}},{"id":3296,"name":"Gino Medina","realName":"Gino Medina","picture":"Gino Medina.jpg","ability":44,"currentAbility":53,"potentialAbility":53,"charisma":67,"micSkills":44,"popularity":3,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":69,"injuryProne":90,"type":"wrestler","style":"high flyer","gender":"M","weight":100,"height":185,"base":"Mexico","birthplace":"Mexico","dateOfBirth":"1996-01-04T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2015-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Employing a variety of ranas and finesse in his matches, Gino oozes confidence. Despite being in his young 20s, Gino is a veteran of the ring having made his debut at the tender age of 6 as a mini in a match.\r\n\r\nLucha is not only in his blood but has been the family business for decades. Gino’s father, the late El Sanguinario, was a renowned luchador and member of the iconic Gringos Locos faction alongside Konnan and Eddie Guerrero among others.\r\n\r\nBorn into Mexican nobility, the chic luchador believes he is the essence of greatness and it’s hard to argue with the results when he gets in the ring.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":48,"storytelling":54,"productFit":24,"riskTaking":38,"matchLayout":56,"psychology":48,"workerManagement":24,"trainingIntensity":67,"technicalCoaching":56,"characterCoaching":45,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":62,"mediaHandling":45,"brandBuilding":50,"socialMediaSavvy":27,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":5,"reactionSpeed":67,"consistency":69,"awareness":48,"judgement":38}},{"id":3298,"name":"Lou King Sharp","realName":"Lou King Sh