rt, LA Park Jr. is the younger and physically bigger member of Los Parks.  \r\n\r\nLA Park Jr. is a vicious brawler, much like his father, the legendary LA Park. Emerging as part of the new generation of luchadores on the Mexican circuit, LA Park Jr. promises destruction in his wake.\r\n\r\nEmbracing chaos in his fighting style, LA Park Jr. is distinctly different compared to his older brother, middleweight Hijo de LA Park, who has a reputation for being more strategic in the ring.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[2325,2326,2327,2328],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":37,"storytelling":43,"productFit":51,"riskTaking":40,"matchLayout":45,"psychology":37,"workerManagement":51,"trainingIntensity":63,"technicalCoaching":42,"characterCoaching":48,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":60,"mediaHandling":48,"brandBuilding":56,"socialMediaSavvy":33,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":10,"reactionSpeed":63,"consistency":56,"awareness":37,"judgement":43}},{"id":3857,"name":"Jade Cargill","realName":"Jade Cargill","picture":"Jade Cargill.jpg","ability":45,"currentAbility":43,"potentialAbility":43,"charisma":38,"micSkills":48,"popularity":50,"condition":99,"hardcoreAbility":26,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"powerhouse","gender":"F","weight":73,"height":175,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1992-06-03T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2020-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"good","prestige":"mid","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Jade Cargill, a 2020 graduate of the Nightmare Factory, is an American wrestler who works exclusively in America. She is a Small worker who is classed as using a Powerhouse style. She is best known for her work with AEW and NXT. She is married to someone outside the wrestling business. She is the protege of QT Marshall. Sh