"masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Kelsey Raegan, who graduated from D-Von Dudley Academy on 01 November 2019, is an American wrestler who works exclusively in the USA. She is a 5'6\", 114lb worker who is classed as using a Regular style. She has regular tag teams with Chelsea Durden (The Prophecy) and Devlyn Macabre (Venom and Violence). She is best known for her work with SHINE. She is dating someone outside the wrestling business. She is the protege of Gangrel.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":121,"teams":[3493,3877],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":39,"storytelling":44,"productFit":37,"riskTaking":32,"matchLayout":45,"psychology":39,"workerManagement":37,"trainingIntensity":54,"technicalCoaching":32,"characterCoaching":58,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":68,"mediaHandling":58,"brandBuilding":57,"socialMediaSavvy":48,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":7,"reactionSpeed":54,"consistency":47,"awareness":39,"judgement":38},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-4295","wrestlerId":4295,"promotionId":121,"startDate":"2021-06-13T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":4296,"name":"Charles Mason","realName":"Charles Mason","picture":"Charles Mason.jpg","ability":43,"currentAbility":49,"potentialAbility":49,"charisma":44,"micSkills":54,"popularity":4,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":43,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"powerhouse","gender":"M","weight":91,"height":170,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1993-05-29T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2017-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"heel","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"They say money is the root of all evil, and that has never rung more true with someone quite like Charles Mason. A product of the House of Glory school, Charles was not always as you see him today. In fact, he begun his career as a long-haired, fun-loving kid from Hewlett Bay Park, New York. Interacting with the poor scum of New York took it's toll on Charles mentally and made him reconsider the path he was on. Unsatisfied, Mason amassed a life of wealth to seperate himself from the common man. Now making his summer residence in Palm Springs, California and living life like a king, Charles surrounds himself with people attending to his every need for life's more trivial things such as cooking and picking up his dry cleaning. If you just so happen to be poor, or an attractive young woman, it would be wise to stay far, far, away from Charles....","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":77,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":43,"storytelling":49,"productFit":25,"riskTaking":38,"matchLayout":51,"psychology":43,"workerManagement":25,"trainingIntensity":72,"technicalCoaching":39,"characterCoaching":63,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":62,"mediaHandling":63,"brandBuilding":47,"socialMediaSavvy":67,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":5,"reactionSpeed":72,"consistency":66,"awareness":43,"judgement":36},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-4296","wrestlerId":4296,"promotionId":77,"startDate":"2021-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":4297,"name":"Juria Nagano","realName":"Juria Nagano","picture":"Juria Nagano.jpg","ability":30,"currentAbility":38,"potentialAbility":38,"charisma":47,"micSkills":32,"popularity":3,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":23,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"stri