 son, J-Rose is the swiss army knife that keeps many of your favorite independents in tip-top shape. A graphic designer, video editor, creative team member, Rose wears many hats in his everyday life working in independent wrestling. A beloved figure for not only his hard work, but the heart of gold he wears on his sleeve at all times. Has partaken in the occasional angle, particularly his dislike of Nolan Edward which led to a loser leaves town match with Sandra Moone for the season 1 finale of No Hook in Paradigm Pro Wrestling. A very ambitious and goal-orientated individual, No Hook was entirely J's brainchild and has enjoyed two seasons thus far. At 23 years old, it's safe to assume that his best ideas are yet to come.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":77,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":0,"storytelling":0,"productFit":42,"riskTaking":100,"matchLayout":0,"psychology":0,"workerManagement":42,"trainingIntensity":0,"technicalCoaching":0,"characterCoaching":71,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":0,"mediaHandling":71,"brandBuilding":42,"socialMediaSavvy":53,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":8,"reactionSpeed":0,"consistency":0,"awareness":0,"judgement":17},"contract":{"id":"tew-contract-4431","wrestlerId":4431,"promotionId":77,"startDate":"2020-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000,"bookingsPerMonth":4,"type":"non-exclusive","status":"active","autoRenew":false},"contractExpiryDate":"2026-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","wage":1000},{"id":4432,"name":"Raychell Rose","realName":"Raychell Rose","picture":"Raychell Rose.jpg","ability":40,"currentAbility":47,"potentialAbility":47,"charisma":59,"micSkills":60,"popularity":1,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":33,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"technical","gender":"F","weight":72,"height":162,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1996-06-16T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2018-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Raychell Rose is an American wrestler who works exclusively in America. She is a Small worker who is classed as using a Regular style. She is best known for her work with DPW.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":38,"storytelling":42,"productFit":27,"riskTaking":39,"matchLayout":43,"psychology":38,"workerManagement":27,"trainingIntensity":61,"technicalCoaching":53,"characterCoaching":45,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":61,"mediaHandling":45,"brandBuilding":62,"socialMediaSavvy":30,"ruleKnowledge":25,"positioning":25,"reactionSpeed":61,"consistency":52,"awareness":38,"judgement":34}},{"id":4433,"name":"James Darnell","realName":"James Darnell","picture":"James Darnell.jpg","ability":42,"currentAbility":45,"potentialAbility":45,"charisma":31,"micSkills":49,"popularity":2,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":39,"injuryProne":81,"type":"wrestler","style":"striker","gender":"M","weight":111,"height":182,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1996-04-14T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2021-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"James Darnell, best known by his online pseudonym CMPulse, is an American Youtuber, Twitch Streamer and Podcast host. He started his Youtube channel doing running commentary for WWE Games primarily based around professional wrestler CM Punk. As the years went on and Pulse's popularity grew, he became a mainstay in the online wrestling community and outstretched his talents to the worlds of podcasting with the Deadlock podcast and social media influencing with his forum Machinmapalooza. Since 2015, Darnell has made a concentrated effort to lose a considerable amount of weight in order to fufill his long time dream of becoming a professional wrestler where he has been trained thus far by Steve Corino. Looks like somebody is going to have get in the Money Clippa! GET CLIPPED!","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[3696],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":57,"storytelling":55,"productFit":10,"riskTaking":48,"matchLayout":54,"psychology":57,"workerManagement":10,"trainingIntensity":52,"technicalCoaching":32,"characterCoaching":45,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":52,"mediaHandling":45,"brandBuilding":24,"socialMediaSavvy":35,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":2,"reactionSpeed":52,"consistency":58,"awareness":57,"judgement":38}},{"id":4434,"name":"John Blud","realName":"John Blud","picture":"John Blud.jpg","ability":38,"currentAbility":32,"potentialAbility":32,"charisma":33,"micSkills":21,"popularity":1,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":35,"injuryProne":100,"type":"commentator","style":"all rounder","gender":"M","weight":100,"height":182,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"1993-11-25T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2021-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"The fearless leader of the streaming group New Legacy Inc, John E. Blud (Jawnny) has been streaming for well over a decade, starting on Justin.tv (The precursor to Twitch) as a 16-year-old in the late 2000s. Prior to streaming, John worked for CZW as a sound technician. Jawnny would eventually form New Legacy Inc with LT, Slip and Blake, all of whom he met through wrestling forums, beginning a decade of decadence, accidentally exposing hilarious bugs, and raising literally hundreds of thousands for charity with Fighting Back. In December 2019, he was invited to co-host the Deadlock Podcast by his good friend Anthony Douglas (TonyPizzaGuy) as James was vacationing in Japan. But the temporary gig quickly turned permanent, as the trio of pals exuded chemistry. Infamously was banned from the MPire Mall after a UMAD episode which poked fun of an e-fed named Victory Road Wrestling.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":26,"storytelling":28,"productFit":0,"riskTaking":59,"matchLayout":29,"psychology":26,"workerManagement":0,"trainingIntensity":44,"technicalCoaching":20,"characterCoaching":66,"diagnosis":50,"rehabilitation":50,"prevention":41,"mediaHandling":66,"brandBuilding":32,"socialMediaSavvy":47,"ruleKnowledge":0,"positioning":0,"reactionSpeed":44,"consistency":43,"awareness":26,"judgement":16}},{"id":4435,"name":"Bojack","realName":"Bojack","picture":"BoJack.jpg","ability":66,"currentAbility":57,"potentialAbility":57,"charisma":52,"micSkills":49,"popularity":1,"condition":100,"hardcoreAbility":53,"injuryProne":100,"type":"wrestler","style":"powerhouse","gender":"M","weight":161,"height":180,"base":"USA","birthplace":"United States","dateOfBirth":"2000-01-07T00:00:00.000Z","debut":"2017-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","morale":"broken","prestige":"low","presentation":"face","cardPosition":"lower","masked":false,"retired":false,"dead":false,"story":"Bojack is an American wrestler who works exclusively in America. He is a Big Heavyweight who is classed as using a Powerhouse style. He is best known for his work with PWF and Deadlock Pro Wrestling.","alterEgos":[],"managerId":0,"acceptsIndieBookings":false,"promotionId":null,"teams":[3696],"record":{"wins":0,"losses":0,"draws":0},"history":{"matches":[],"jobs":[],"titles":[]},"staffAttributes":{"bookingLogic":57,"storytelling":59,"productFit":35,"riskTak